00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Mr. Secretary,

asr-000222
00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: this committee will listen

asr-000223
00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:26.480
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: attentively to your

