asr-000242
00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:04.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Also to our sponsor,

asr-000243
00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:06.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Representative Albert

asr-000244
00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:08.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Garcia. I will

asr-000245
00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: present to you the

asr-000246
00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: National Expenditure

asr-000247
00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Program for Fiscal Year 2027

asr-000248
00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: for the Department of Health.

asr-000249
00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.890
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Can we put up the

asr-000250
00:13:19.890 --> 00:14:19.960
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: first slide, please? Bakit wala? Bakit hindi pa?

asr-000251
00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: We sent po and checked the

asr-000252
00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: copy earlier. It's with the

asr-000253
00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:50.930
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: committee na po.

asr-000254
00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.930
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: May we request our technical

asr-000255
00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.930
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: team to

asr-000256
00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.930
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: display the presentation

asr-000257
00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.930
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: of DOH on the screen?

asr-000258
00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:43.520
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, while waiting for the presentation of the DOH, may we first acknowledge the chairman of the Committee on Health.

asr-000259
00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:51.960
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: May we recognize Chair Gato for his manifestation habang iniintay po natin yung presentation ng DOH.

asr-000260
00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.580
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Chair Gato, please proceed.

asr-000261
00:16:54.320 --> 00:17:05.280
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Thank you, Mr. Chair, esteemed colleagues, Secretary Edwin Mercado and family, DOH family. Magandang umaga po.

asr-000262
00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:16.000
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Sabi nila, walang kinikilalang yaman o estado sa buhay ang sakit. Illnesses do not discriminate.

asr-000263
00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:28.280
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Yes, they do. Because while a disease like cancer may afflict anyone, it does not affect everyone equally.

asr-000264
00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:35.400
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: The difference is often not in the disease itself, but in what comes after the diagnosis.

asr-000265
00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:45.920
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Who can begin treatment immediately, who has to wait, who can sustain years of care, and who is forced into debt simply to keep going.

asr-000266
00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:51.360
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: And sometimes, the difference is simply who gets to survive.

asr-000267
00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.040
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: This is the reality that the Department of Health

asr-000268
00:17:55.060 --> 00:18:06.280
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: continues to confront, while carrying the enormous responsibility of protecting the health and well-being of more than 100 million Filipinos.

asr-000269
00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:11.240
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: The challenges before the DOH are immense and constantly evolving.

asr-000270
00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:20.260
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Yet, it continues to strengthen primary and public health care, expand access to essential medicines and life-saving interventions,

asr-000271
00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:25.040
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: advance universal health care, strengthen local health services,

asr-000272
00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:33.420
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: support our healthcare workers, and protect our communities through prevention and health promotion, like immunization.

asr-000273
00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:42.400
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Mr. Chair, as Chair of the Department of Health, as Chair of the Committee on Health, the House of Representatives,

asr-000274
00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:49.500
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: may I express my full and unequivocal support for the proposed budget of the Department of Health.

asr-000275
00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:54.860
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Bung puso po natin sinusuportahan ang panukalang budget ng Department of Health.

asr-000276
00:18:55.320 --> 00:19:03.100
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Because health is a right and not a privilege, at ang karapatan nito ay hindi dapat nakadepende sa kakayahan magbayad.

asr-000277
00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:08.040
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: No Filipino should have to delay treatment because they cannot afford it.

asr-000278
00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:15.900
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: No family should have to choose between continuing a course of treatment and meeting their most basic needs.

asr-000279
00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:22.380
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: And no one should be left behind simply because the care they need is beyond their means.

asr-000281
00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:40.380
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Our budget must reflect this principle. Mr. Chair, my dear colleagues, let us give the DOH the capacity to respond, our healthcare workers the support they deserve, and our communities the services they need.

asr-000282
00:19:41.120 --> 00:20:03.240
Rep. Ciriaco B. Gato Jr., M.D., FPSO-HNS: Let us approve a health budget that is not merely adequate, but responsive to the realities of our people, equitable in its reach, and worthy of the right to health that we have pledged to uphold. Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair. Mabuhay ang healthcare workers. Mabuhay ang Department of Health. Thank you.

asr-000293
00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:14.620
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Chair Siriaco Gato, Committee on Health, for your manifestation of support to the budget of the Department of Health.

asr-000294
00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.440
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000295
00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:21.320
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, I see that the presentation is now flashed on the screen.

asr-000296
00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, I would like to recognize once again.

asr-000297
00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:29.740
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: So, once again, our Secretary of Health, Dr. Edwin Mercado, for your presentation.

asr-000298
00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:30.660
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Please proceed.

asr-000299
00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:31.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Thank you.

asr-000300
00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:35.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Maraming salamat po, Rep. Kong Abet Garcia.

asr-000301
00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:41.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At muli po, magandang umaga po sa lahat po ng ating members ng Appropriations Committee.

asr-000302
00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:48.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po yung ating presentation on the 2027 National Healthcare Expenditure.

asr-000303
00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

asr-000304
00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:54.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang ating pong vision is to make the Filipinos among the best.

asr-000305
00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:56.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: The healthiest people in Asia by 2014.

asr-000306
00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.960
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, that means also making sure that they have access to quality healthcare.

asr-000307
00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:05.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And as Kong Gato mentioned earlier, financial risk protection.

asr-000308
00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:17.760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang ating pong hangad ay talagang yung pagpapalatag po ng ating universal healthcare program, which I will expound on later.

asr-000309
00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:18.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

asr-000310
00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:23.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, nung ako po ay natalaga bilang kaliin po ng kalusugan.

asr-000311
00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:29.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Three weeks ago, nag-draft na po kami ng Unified Health Agenda,

asr-000312
00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:34.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ang katawagin po namin ay UNA, with PCO Bev Ho.

asr-000313
00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:39.160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: For the first time po, nagkaroon ng common agenda po ang DOH at PhilHealth.

asr-000314
00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:47.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At pinagkabit po namin yung mga programa ng PhilHealth na dapat pong bigyan din ng suporta ng DOH and vice versa po.

asr-000315
00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:53.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mga programa rin ng DOH na kailangan pong suportahan ng ating PhilHealth.

asr-000316
00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:54.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang...

asr-000317
00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:59.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang stronger alignment is along four or five major pillars.

asr-000318
00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:12.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang una po dyan ay yung healthy schools, workplace, and communities, which will be focusing on prevention, health promotion, early screening, and linking to PhilHealth benefits like the YACAP and the gamot.

asr-000319
00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:22.060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, i-embed na rin po namin dyan yung ating pong mga health programs para po at the level of the settings na kung saan po natin imimit mismo yung ating mga kababayan,

asr-000320
00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:24.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay mabibigyan na po natin.

asr-000321
00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:29.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang all-in-one po na approach itong ating primary health care.

asr-000322
00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:42.700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang pangalawa nga po, patungo dun sa primary health care, ay tiyakin din pong merong access sa mga doktor, sa mga gamot, at sa mga procedures na at least essential procedures po na i-cover natin.

asr-000323
00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:54.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya, gaya po, at didiscuss naman po ito ng PCO Bev, palalawakin po yung coverage ng ating YACAP sa kasalukuyang labing dalawa, labing tatlong lab test tomorrow.

asr-000324
00:22:54.660 --> 00:22:56.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And also the gamot.

asr-000325
00:22:57.140 --> 00:23:00.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pangatatlo po ay equality and efficient hospital.

asr-000326
00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:04.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ako po ay mag-create ng hospital operations cluster.

asr-000327
00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:09.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi almost 40% po ng budget ng DOH are on hospital operations.

asr-000328
00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:15.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun po yung pinakamalaking cost component ng aming budget.

asr-000329
00:23:15.340 --> 00:23:21.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya, kailangan din po natin siguruduhin na efficient yung pagde-deliver ng ating mga hospital.

asr-000330
00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:24.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yun naman po yung aking, kung tawagin, 40.

asr-000331
00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:28.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi ito po ang aking ginawa nung ako po ay nasa private sector pa lang.

asr-000332
00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:32.400
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang pang-apat po ay yung information technology transformation.

asr-000333
00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:36.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So easier access and front-facing of our patients.

asr-000334
00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:45.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kung ano po, ito po rin yung ating pagkukuna ng datos para po yung ating mga health programs ay mas maging data-driven evidence-based.

asr-000335
00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:53.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ang pang-lima po ay strong institution and health workforce, particularly to address the persistent health workforce issues.

asr-000336
00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:55.820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And service delivery gaps.

asr-000337
00:23:56.420 --> 00:24:04.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So the end goal po is to move UHC from policy to practice and to ensure that its benefits are actually experienced by every Filipino.

asr-000338
00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:13.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So we will be more proactive in reaching out to our, at hindi po yung hinihintay pang sila ay magkasakit para pumasok dito sa ating healthcare system.

asr-000339
00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:15.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide please.

asr-000340
00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:23.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So gaya po ng nabanggit ni Kong Abet, ang kabuan po ng aming budget ay 353.8 billion.

asr-000341
00:24:23.580 --> 00:24:26.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Based po on our approved NEP.

asr-000342
00:24:26.540 --> 00:24:30.760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At along our five pillars, dinistribute po namin itong ating budget.

asr-000343
00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:38.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito po yung pakikita ko mamaya kung bakit po ganito ang aming distribution at ano po yung mga programang ating gagawin.

asr-000344
00:24:39.620 --> 00:24:40.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So next slide please.

asr-000345
00:24:42.320 --> 00:24:49.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So sa kabuan po in the current administration of President Ferdinand Marcos Jr.

asr-000346
00:24:49.020 --> 00:24:53.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ay 1.97 trillion na po ang talagang nailaan.

asr-000347
00:24:53.580 --> 00:24:54.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para po sa healthcare.

asr-000348
00:24:54.580 --> 00:25:04.700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ay significant dahil sa unang pagkakataon ho, yung ating healthcare expenditure or current healthcare expenditure noong 2025.

asr-000349
00:25:04.920 --> 00:25:07.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Base po doon sa ating Philippine Statistics Authority.

asr-000350
00:25:08.560 --> 00:25:15.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun po yung unang pagkakataon na yung ating government spending ay humigit kaysa doon sa out-of-pocket spending.

asr-000351
00:25:16.420 --> 00:25:19.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang may isa lang pong one-off noong COVID.

asr-000352
00:25:19.380 --> 00:25:22.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi marami talaga pong naglagay tayo, naglaan.

asr-000353
00:25:23.100 --> 00:25:23.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Marami.

asr-000354
00:25:23.580 --> 00:25:25.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ating government spending ay humigit kaysa doon sa out-of-pocket spending.

asr-000355
00:25:25.580 --> 00:25:37.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ngayon po on regular basis, ang healthcare expenditure of government increased from 42.1% in 2023 to current 46.5% in 2025.

asr-000356
00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:45.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Such that the out-of-pocket spending of the Filipinos were brought down from 44.4% to 41.2%.

asr-000357
00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:49.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito'y pagpapatunay pong kumakapit na po yung mga programa natin.

asr-000358
00:25:50.100 --> 00:25:52.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito pong ating 2027.

asr-000359
00:25:53.580 --> 00:26:05.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And NEP, ay gaya ng nabanggit ni Kong Abet, ay 4.9, ay mas mababa po ng 21.2% compared to 2026 GAA.

asr-000360
00:26:05.860 --> 00:26:09.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Bagamat ito po ay 10% higher noong 2026 NEP.

asr-000361
00:26:09.520 --> 00:26:23.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero sa kabuan po, ito ay nagkoconstitute po ng 4.9% of our 7.2 trillion national budget and 1.1% of the projected 2027 GDP.

asr-000362
00:26:23.580 --> 00:26:32.240
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kung tutusin po, medyo mababa pa rin po kasi ang usual po na GDP health to GDP ratio po is nasa 8 to 10%.

asr-000363
00:26:32.240 --> 00:26:40.960
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So tayo po ay, although ito po ay spending lang ng government, if you say that government is spending 46%, assuming 1%,

asr-000364
00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:46.400
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kung inidagdag po natin yung private spending, abot pa rin po ng mga 2.53%.

asr-000365
00:26:46.400 --> 00:26:50.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Medyo mababa po compared dun sa talaga pong dapat na ibigay for healthcare.

asr-000366
00:26:51.460 --> 00:26:53.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But health remains a majority.

asr-000367
00:26:53.580 --> 00:26:56.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: National priority and investment in terms of human capital.

asr-000368
00:26:56.980 --> 00:26:57.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

asr-000369
00:26:58.920 --> 00:27:05.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So gaya ng nasabi ko po, ang pinakamalaking component po nitong ating budget ay sa maintenance and other operating expense.

asr-000370
00:27:06.480 --> 00:27:14.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nakasama naman po dito sa MOOE, yung iba pong mga subscription for managed services, etc.

asr-000371
00:27:14.780 --> 00:27:19.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya nga po gaya ng nasabi ko, bulk of this will be coming from hospital operations.

asr-000372
00:27:19.840 --> 00:27:23.400
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: That's why I want to really make sure that this is properly used.

asr-000373
00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:29.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang personal service po ay tumaas ng 77% to 117 billion.

asr-000374
00:27:29.820 --> 00:27:34.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po ay dahil dun sa full implementation na po ng ating salary standardization law.

asr-000375
00:27:35.060 --> 00:27:39.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nasa huling yugtunan po tayo dun sa implementation ng SSL.

asr-000376
00:27:39.760 --> 00:27:45.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung capital outlay po yung medyo malaki po yung nabawas, kumpara nun 2026.

asr-000377
00:27:45.540 --> 00:27:47.680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po ay bumaba ng 35%.

asr-000378
00:27:47.680 --> 00:27:52.980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At karamihan pa po dito sa 19, or hindi naman karamihan, may portion po dito sa 19 billion.

asr-000379
00:27:53.580 --> 00:27:59.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Almost 4.2 billion po ay nakalaan na po para dun sa Health System Resilience Project

asr-000380
00:27:59.740 --> 00:28:03.760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na tayo po ay merong World Bank loan na na-approve po nung 2025.

asr-000381
00:28:03.980 --> 00:28:07.080
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yun nga po, pinupush na naming magamit.

asr-000382
00:28:07.580 --> 00:28:14.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po ay nakalaan sa 17 probinsya po, ayon po dun sa ating naging loan agreement with the World Bank.

asr-000383
00:28:15.100 --> 00:28:21.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung iba naman po ay HVEP, 14.5 billion, which includes the facilities, infrastructures, and the equipment.

asr-000384
00:28:22.660 --> 00:28:23.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide, please.

asr-000385
00:28:23.580 --> 00:28:30.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So nais ko lang po ngayong himayin yung mga programa po natin kada pilar.

asr-000386
00:28:30.400 --> 00:28:33.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ang unang pilar na Healthy Schools, Workplace, and Communities.

asr-000387
00:28:35.980 --> 00:28:43.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Karamihan po dyan ay yung mga syntax revenue for the payment of the indirect contributors of PhilHealth.

asr-000388
00:28:43.700 --> 00:28:49.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ay sumasaklaw sa 19.3 indirect contributors, 55.4.

asr-000389
00:28:49.580 --> 00:28:53.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero kung tutuusin po natin yung gastusin ng PhilHealth,

asr-000390
00:28:53.580 --> 00:29:01.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para po i-cover yung benefit expense nitong ating mga indirect members, medyo po kulang po yung 55.4 million.

asr-000391
00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:10.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa kasulukuyan po, ipapaliwanag naman ni PCEO Bevian, pero sumisipa na po yung indirect members

asr-000392
00:29:10.100 --> 00:29:15.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasi meron na po silang consciousness na sila pala ay merong beneficio at immediate eligibility.

asr-000393
00:29:16.280 --> 00:29:18.960
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So nakikita po talaga namin nag-avail na.

asr-000394
00:29:19.540 --> 00:29:22.460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung 2.5 billion po ay for health promotion.

asr-000395
00:29:23.580 --> 00:29:27.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kakabit na natin dun sa setting-based impanelment ng YACAP.

asr-000396
00:29:27.460 --> 00:29:33.160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Itong kasabay na yung health promotion, lalong-lalo na po dun sa ating mga schools

asr-000397
00:29:33.160 --> 00:29:38.980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para po maturuan na kaagad natin yung ating mga kabataan, ano po yung tamang mga habits to be healthy.

asr-000398
00:29:39.840 --> 00:29:46.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yung 1.3 billion po ay sa health emergency preparedness, response, quarantine service, and international health surveillance.

asr-000399
00:29:46.640 --> 00:29:53.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Di po lingid sa atin, meron po tayong problema ngayon ng HACE dahil po cross-boundary na po ang issue.

asr-000400
00:29:53.580 --> 00:30:00.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pati po yung mga emerging diseases like Ebola, yun po yung transfer.

asr-000401
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:05.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na po o zoonotic disease na nagmumula sa mga hayop, lumilipat na po sa mga tao.

asr-000402
00:30:05.540 --> 00:30:16.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po ay sanhinan ng ating global warming, kaya po talagang dapat paglaanan at pagpagpreparahan ito po ang ating response na ito.

asr-000403
00:30:16.840 --> 00:30:17.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next po.

asr-000404
00:30:19.160 --> 00:30:23.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ang bunga ng ating focus sa ating primary care system.

asr-000405
00:30:23.300 --> 00:30:30.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Two out of three children are fully immunized, although ito po ay mababa pa dun sa ating target na 95%.

asr-000406
00:30:30.840 --> 00:30:32.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po talaga ipupush natin.

asr-000407
00:30:33.500 --> 00:30:40.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung eight out of ten children aged two years old and below with adequate height and age, ito po yung stunting,

asr-000408
00:30:40.720 --> 00:30:49.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay medyo bumaba po from 22.5% ng 2023 to 21.1% for 2025.

asr-000409
00:30:49.300 --> 00:30:52.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Bagumat yun po ay malayo pa rin po dun sa ating mga target.

asr-000410
00:30:52.900 --> 00:30:56.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Lalo na po dun sa millennium development goal targets natin.

asr-000411
00:30:57.040 --> 00:31:03.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong household na may access sa basic water supply ay nasa 82.74%.

asr-000412
00:31:03.100 --> 00:31:05.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang target po natin ay 94%.

asr-000413
00:31:05.800 --> 00:31:14.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong mga Pilipinong pamilya na meron pong access sa modern family planning methods ay nasa 64.5%.

asr-000414
00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:16.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang target po natin ay 72.5%.

asr-000415
00:31:17.720 --> 00:31:21.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ang may TB po, meron naman po tayong 85%.

asr-000416
00:31:22.900 --> 00:31:28.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Na yun po ang ating target na accomplished po natin na yung pong nadadiagnose ng TB ay nabibigyan ng gamot.

asr-000417
00:31:29.620 --> 00:31:39.540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito pong ating Pilipino na living with HIV, medyo malayo pa rin dun sa ating target na 95% kasi ngayon po ay nasa 66% pa rin po.

asr-000418
00:31:40.040 --> 00:31:47.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero meron na po kaming ginagawang mga programa na palialawigin po yung OHAT program ng PhilHealth

asr-000419
00:31:47.120 --> 00:31:52.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na iko-cover na rin yung ating mga preparatory or preemptive.

asr-000420
00:31:52.900 --> 00:32:01.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yung testing po palalawigin din natin para po maitaas natin dun sa ating target na 95%.

asr-000421
00:32:01.480 --> 00:32:10.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At dun naman po sa mental health ay 262,000 po ang ating individual na nakakuha po ng gamot for mental health.

asr-000422
00:32:10.980 --> 00:32:11.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide please.

asr-000423
00:32:13.860 --> 00:32:18.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasama po din dito sa ating first, second pillar na functional primary care,

asr-000424
00:32:18.280 --> 00:32:22.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung ating pong family health, immunization, nutrition, and responsible care.

asr-000425
00:32:22.900 --> 00:32:28.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yung ating parenting, which is pegged at 9.1 billion.

asr-000426
00:32:28.700 --> 00:32:32.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito po ay tatargetin po natin yung mga vulnerable population.

asr-000427
00:32:32.960 --> 00:32:39.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Gaya po ng mga senior citizen, mga may edad na, mga bata, at yung po meron ng pre-existing disease.

asr-000428
00:32:39.960 --> 00:32:46.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ganon din po sa communicable disease prevention, which includes TB and HIV, 6.9 billion.

asr-000429
00:32:46.360 --> 00:32:52.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa non-communicable disease, ito naman po yung mga emerging diseases due to modern living,

asr-000430
00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:56.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: depression, diabetes, mental health, 2.7 billion.

asr-000431
00:32:56.500 --> 00:33:02.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At dito po sa local health system development, dahil gusto nga natin, because of our devolved nature,

asr-000432
00:33:02.480 --> 00:33:07.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: talaga pong matulungan yung local government units na palakasin yung kanilang local health system,

asr-000433
00:33:07.460 --> 00:33:13.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay may nakalaan po tayong 1.5 billion, which will cover 110 UHC integration sites.

asr-000434
00:33:14.420 --> 00:33:15.080
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

asr-000435
00:33:17.150 --> 00:33:24.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasama pa rin po dito sa ating next pillar ay yung ating pong mga functional primary care,

asr-000436
00:33:24.470 --> 00:33:33.810
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: system, nakikita po dito na ang ating pong benefit payment noong 2025 sa PhilHealth ay umabot po ng higit 300 billion.

asr-000437
00:33:34.410 --> 00:33:42.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po ay 82% increase from the previous year, reflecting the significant expansion of PhilHealth financing for member healthcare access.

asr-000438
00:33:43.570 --> 00:33:52.230
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasama rin po dito yung pagpapalabak po ng yakap na sa kasalukuyan po mula 27.8 million noong 2024,

asr-000439
00:33:52.230 --> 00:33:54.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay umabot po ng 40 million.

asr-000440
00:33:54.370 --> 00:34:08.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na Pilipinos ang registered with YAKAP. Although may mga ginawa po kaming programa para linisin yung tala ng YAKAP, kasi may mga old YAKAP na automatic empanelment na nagre-reklamo po sa amin bakit kami na-empanel, di naman namin

asr-000441
00:34:08.380 --> 00:34:10.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: alam. So tinanggal po namin yun

asr-000442
00:34:10.280 --> 00:34:14.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at naglilinis po kami. Kasi meron na po moving forward ng biometrics

asr-000443
00:34:14.480 --> 00:34:18.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para matiyak na yung pinagkakakilanlan ng ating pasyente ay talagang

asr-000444
00:34:18.600 --> 00:34:20.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: siya 'yun bago ma-enroll

asr-000445
00:34:20.320 --> 00:34:22.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dito sa YAKAP. Meron po tayong

asr-000446
00:34:22.560 --> 00:34:24.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 40,000 cancer patients

asr-000447
00:34:24.660 --> 00:34:26.700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na nakatanggap sa Cancer Assistance Fund.

asr-000450
00:34:27.370 --> 00:34:33.190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po tayong 2,000 health infrastructure projects na na-kompleto mula 2023 hanggang 2025.

asr-000451
00:34:33.970 --> 00:34:39.070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po tayong higit limang, almost 5,000 medical equipment procured and delivered

asr-000452
00:34:39.070 --> 00:34:45.670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: and nearly 500 medical transport vehicles provided for emergency response and patient referral.

asr-000453
00:34:45.930 --> 00:34:49.950
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Actually, ito pong ambulansya, meron na rin po tayong coverage of Hill Health.

asr-000454
00:34:50.370 --> 00:34:53.330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pati ito po yung mga registered or licensed ambulance.

asr-000455
00:34:53.330 --> 00:34:57.590
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pinag-aaralan po kung pwede na rin maka-cover yung patient transport vehicles

asr-000456
00:34:57.590 --> 00:35:02.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dahil yun naman po yung pinakamalimit na nagagamit sa pagtatransfer po ng ating pasyente.

asr-000457
00:35:02.990 --> 00:35:03.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

asr-000458
00:35:04.970 --> 00:35:10.330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So dito naman po sa ating mga hospital, gaya na nasabi ko po sa inyo kanina,

asr-000459
00:35:10.470 --> 00:35:17.390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 102.9 billion of the budget is going to the 71 DOH regional hospital

asr-000460
00:35:17.390 --> 00:35:21.210
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: which total has about 20,000 licensed bed

asr-000461
00:35:21.210 --> 00:35:28.310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: and also 26.9 billion for the operation of the 12 DOH hospitals in Metro Manila

asr-000462
00:35:28.310 --> 00:35:30.410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: with 9,000 licensed bed

asr-000463
00:35:30.410 --> 00:35:35.510
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at ang 8.1 billion naman po ay for the government-owned and specialty hospital

asr-000464
00:35:35.510 --> 00:35:40.530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasama po dyan ang Lung Center, NKTI, ang Philippine Heart Center

asr-000465
00:35:40.530 --> 00:35:42.830
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at saka po ang Philippine Children's Medical Center.

asr-000466
00:35:42.830 --> 00:35:50.150
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kung tutuusin po ang total number of beds po nitong tatlong classification or buckets ng ating DOH hospital,

asr-000467
00:35:51.210 --> 00:35:56.230
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ito ng 28% of the total bed capacity of 118,000 for the whole country.

asr-000468
00:35:57.010 --> 00:36:01.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So malaking portion po talaga ay provided by DOH hospitals.

asr-000469
00:36:02.830 --> 00:36:07.070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Karagdagan pong 19 billion doon sa PhilHealth benefit package improvement

asr-000470
00:36:07.070 --> 00:36:14.870
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasi nagkaroon na po tayo ng roadmap kung ano po yung mga panibagong mga benepisyong ilalabas sa susunod pong taon.

asr-000471
00:36:15.310 --> 00:36:17.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Karamihan po dyan pagpapalawig ng cancer,

asr-000472
00:36:18.210 --> 00:36:20.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pagkasama po yung iba pa nating mga sakit,

asr-000473
00:36:21.210 --> 00:36:25.690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at ito naman pong HVEP ay nabanggit ko na kanina,

asr-000474
00:36:25.850 --> 00:36:31.990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 514 health facilities, 845 equipment project, and 345 medical transport vehicle.

asr-000475
00:36:32.710 --> 00:36:33.290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next po.

asr-000476
00:36:34.450 --> 00:36:38.930
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ang pang-apat na pillar po ay itong iting ITE transformation.

asr-000477
00:36:39.750 --> 00:36:47.690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So nakita ko rin po na doon sa health resilience loan natin sa World Bank ay meron pong component ng IT.

asr-000478
00:36:47.690 --> 00:36:51.170
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun po yung itatap ko para na maumpisa na po natin.

asr-000479
00:36:51.210 --> 00:36:59.070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung very basic NHDR o yung pong interoperability layer ng ating kahit po yung primary care muna,

asr-000480
00:36:59.270 --> 00:37:08.050
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: maikapit na natin dahil po nire-require na namin yung mga yakap facilities na kumuha po ng compliant na EMR provider

asr-000481
00:37:08.050 --> 00:37:11.210
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para po mas madali na nating maikonect.

asr-000482
00:37:11.930 --> 00:37:14.310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi po ang magiging resulta nito,

asr-000483
00:37:14.850 --> 00:37:19.090
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pag nagawa na po for example yung isang x-ray o isang lab test sa isang clinic,

asr-000484
00:37:19.090 --> 00:37:20.930
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: hindi na kailangan ulitin.

asr-000485
00:37:20.930 --> 00:37:24.530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kapag ang pasyente po ay lumipat ng panibagong facility.

asr-000486
00:37:24.530 --> 00:37:26.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi ngayon po, inuulit eh.

asr-000487
00:37:26.730 --> 00:37:29.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So medyo may tapon po tayo doon.

asr-000488
00:37:29.570 --> 00:37:33.650
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya kung meron na po tayong integration, mas mababawasan po yun.

asr-000489
00:37:33.650 --> 00:37:36.490
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasama rin po yung epidemiology and surveillance dito,

asr-000490
00:37:36.490 --> 00:37:38.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: saka yung health statistics na gaya ng sinabi ko,

asr-000491
00:37:38.850 --> 00:37:44.050
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: itatap din namin dito sa NHDR para makuha po natin yung live data.

asr-000492
00:37:44.050 --> 00:37:50.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi ngayon po, ang datos kinukuha lang upon reporting of the LGU health units,

asr-000493
00:37:50.930 --> 00:37:52.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: minsan po may lag time eh.

asr-000494
00:37:52.370 --> 00:37:54.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Whereas kapag ito ay through the EMR,

asr-000495
00:37:54.770 --> 00:37:59.010
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mas madali po nating makukuha live yung ating data.

asr-000496
00:38:01.010 --> 00:38:06.690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang huli po nating pillar ay yung strong institution and health workforce.

asr-000497
00:38:06.690 --> 00:38:11.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So tuloy pa rin po yung ating national health workforce support system.

asr-000498
00:38:11.730 --> 00:38:17.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po tayong 24,381 health professionals that are deployed nationwide.

asr-000499
00:38:17.730 --> 00:38:20.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito po yung tumutulong lalo na po doon sa ating mga

asr-000500
00:38:20.770 --> 00:38:23.330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: third, fourth, fifth class municipalities.

asr-000501
00:38:23.330 --> 00:38:30.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At support din po ng ating mga karagdagang district hospitals for specialists and also for medical care.

asr-000502
00:38:30.850 --> 00:38:35.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At meron din po tayong 1.2 billion for supply chain management.

asr-000503
00:38:35.250 --> 00:38:41.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ang tinitingnan nga po namin ay mas paigtingin pa itong ating IT system ng supply chain

asr-000504
00:38:41.250 --> 00:38:47.090
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para talaga po makuha natin yung mga balances down to the level of the CHD.

asr-000505
00:38:47.090 --> 00:38:52.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ma-predict po natin yung ating turnaround time ng delivery ng ating mga gamot.

asr-000510
00:38:52.370 --> 00:38:56.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ay ang kabuan po. Next slide po.

asr-000511
00:38:56.770 --> 00:39:04.690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Tungo po sa isang health sector na una sa pagtutulungan, una sa pag-usad, una sa pagkakilala.

asr-000512
00:39:04.690 --> 00:39:13.410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po yung ating internal directive at ito po ang internal messaging natin sa ating mga DOH and DOH family.

asr-000513
00:39:13.410 --> 00:39:19.090
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Upang maramdaman po ng ating mga kababayan ang isang servisyong pangkalusugan na mabilis, patas at mapagkakatiwalaan.

asr-000515
00:39:19.970 --> 00:39:22.290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pagkakatiwalaan. Thank you very much

asr-000516
00:39:22.290 --> 00:39:22.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: po.

asr-000517
00:39:23.850 --> 00:39:25.590
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Maraming salamat, Secretary

asr-000518
00:39:25.590 --> 00:39:28.290
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Edwin Mercado, for your very informative

asr-000519
00:39:28.290 --> 00:39:29.530
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: presentation.

asr-000520
00:39:30.390 --> 00:39:32.250
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: And I think the committee is happy

asr-000521
00:39:32.250 --> 00:39:34.410
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: to note that there will be a closer

asr-000522
00:39:34.410 --> 00:39:35.770
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: working,

asr-000523
00:39:36.270 --> 00:39:38.230
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: more efficient relationship between the

asr-000524
00:39:38.230 --> 00:39:39.890
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Department of Health and our

asr-000525
00:39:39.890 --> 00:39:41.810
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: PhilHealth. So that is

asr-000526
00:39:41.810 --> 00:39:44.150
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: a welcome development

asr-000527
00:39:44.150 --> 00:39:45.750
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: and hopefully that will

asr-000528
00:39:45.750 --> 00:39:47.450
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: really redound to

asr-000529
00:39:47.450 --> 00:39:49.790
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: health outcomes

asr-000530
00:39:49.790 --> 00:39:52.110
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: for our people. So thank you very much

asr-000531
00:39:52.110 --> 00:39:52.290
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: po.

asr-000532
00:39:53.910 --> 00:39:55.910
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: Before we proceed, I'd like

asr-000533
00:39:55.910 --> 00:39:58.170
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: to recognize our

asr-000534
00:39:58.170 --> 00:39:59.770
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: ComSec to acknowledge

asr-000535
00:39:59.770 --> 00:40:01.510
Rep. Albert S. Garcia: the new members that just

asr-000536
