02:50:33.360 --> 02:50:34.720
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Where's Director Tan Langit?

asr-002657
02:50:34.720 --> 02:50:36.720
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is he a director?

asr-002658
02:50:36.720 --> 02:50:37.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is he a director or a director?

asr-002659
02:50:38.200 --> 02:50:39.740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Director Tan Langit, yes.

asr-002660
02:50:39.780 --> 02:50:40.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much again.

asr-002661
02:50:41.400 --> 02:50:51.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And with that, we are sure that we are able to have our Rural Health Centers be given a renovation and expansion.

asr-002662
02:50:52.260 --> 02:50:54.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then, of course, the equipment is a part of the 60.

asr-002663
02:50:55.260 --> 02:51:04.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: But once we renovate the equipment, you have also approved the downloading of the FLR for the equipment that's handled by RD.

asr-002664
02:51:04.640 --> 02:51:04.700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-002665
02:51:04.720 --> 02:51:06.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Sir P. Shirley Gaspi.

asr-002666
02:51:06.620 --> 02:51:18.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, my question, Mr. Chairman, is how much budget did you propose to the DBM and how much was given?

asr-002667
02:51:18.620 --> 02:51:20.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: In other words, how much was cut?

asr-002668
02:51:26.250 --> 02:51:33.130
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mr. Chair, the total that we requested was 837 billion.

asr-002669
02:51:34.290 --> 02:51:38.450
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And approved was 353 billion.

asr-002670
02:51:38.450 --> 02:51:39.450
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, a difference.

asr-002671
02:51:40.130 --> 02:51:46.530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: A difference of 485 po ang nabawas doon sa amin pong initial request.

asr-002672
02:51:46.750 --> 02:51:47.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, sir.

asr-002673
02:51:47.390 --> 02:51:47.750
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, sir.

asr-002674
02:51:47.750 --> 02:51:57.350
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Secretary, what are the priority items that you wish to be restored by this committee and the House of Representatives?

asr-002675
