Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun po yung mga nabawas for Metro Manila Hospital, for regional hospitals, and also for the GOCCs para po ma-maintain po natin yung ZIBA.

asr-002735
02:55:45.380 --> 02:55:47.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Almost 12 billion po.

