Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Three items themselves is 170, yes, for the PhilHealth, additional.

asr-002737
02:55:59.260 --> 02:56:03.260
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then 15 billion for HFEP and 12 billion.

