Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi yun po yung initial touch points po.

asr-002892
03:57:58.520 --> 03:58:07.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito po yung pwede nating agarang maging universal kaysa po yung curative na kailangan pang magkasakit para i-avail yung ating mga...

asr-002893
03:58:08.160 --> 03:58:18.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So sa primary care po, pre-emptive, pre-preventive, kahit po walang nararamdaman, ay pwede po nating i-engage na po yung ating mga kababayan.

asr-002894
