Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: So talagang, parang we're kind of left on our own to fend for ourselves.

asr-003479
04:22:41.310 --> 04:22:43.710
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: So I'm really hoping that I can come up with a plan.

asr-003480
04:22:43.710 --> 04:22:50.610
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: I can find out or seek clarification from your office on how do we determine or allocate per province ba?

asr-003481
04:22:51.170 --> 04:22:53.170
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Is there a, how do we go about this?

asr-003482
04:22:53.210 --> 04:22:58.330
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Is it based on the population or how did we come up with these numbers?

asr-003483
04:23:00.390 --> 04:23:03.570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ma'am, Madam Chair, is this for HPEP po?

asr-003484
04:23:04.050 --> 04:23:07.150
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Yes po, for our Health Facilities and Enhancement Program.

asr-003485
04:23:30.420 --> 04:23:35.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: As mentioned earlier, kaya po, yung HPEP requires certain site conditions.

asr-003486
04:23:36.080 --> 04:23:39.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Before we include them in the budget.

asr-003487
04:23:39.740 --> 04:23:43.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So we will coordinate na lang po with your office on the reasons why.

asr-003488
04:23:43.920 --> 04:23:51.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Apparently, may mga deficiencies po dun sa, wala daw pong lang, yung mga requirement po na kailangan.

asr-003489
04:23:51.440 --> 04:23:53.220
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Baka naman pwedeng maayos.

asr-003490
04:23:53.320 --> 04:23:54.600
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Baka we can work on that together.

asr-003491
04:23:54.740 --> 04:23:59.540
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Kasi as I mentioned no, Mr. Secretary, talagang kulang na kulang kami right now.

asr-003492
04:23:59.720 --> 04:24:04.160
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Because we have no DOH hospitals, we have to send our patients if we want a DOH hospital,

asr-003493
04:24:04.160 --> 04:24:05.420
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: either to Cagayan de Oro.

asr-003494
04:24:06.080 --> 04:24:10.500
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: To Davao or ideally, of course, would be one in the province.

asr-003495
04:24:11.020 --> 04:24:15.780
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: But because we still don't have one, ideally, we would really like to seek for more support from the DOH.

asr-003496
04:24:16.520 --> 04:24:25.180
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And so right now, actually, we're very pleased because there is an allocated funding for a Bagong Pilipinas Health Center in Damulog,

asr-003497
04:24:25.560 --> 04:24:29.980
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: which is urgently needed because this particular town in my district is an outlier.

asr-003498
04:24:30.140 --> 04:24:32.040
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: It actually has the highest incidence of poverty.

asr-003499
04:24:32.660 --> 04:24:36.040
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: They're currently asking for 19 million pesos.

asr-003500
04:24:36.200 --> 04:24:40.140
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: To cover x-ray sets, gen sets, water impounding facility.

asr-003501
04:24:40.740 --> 04:24:46.220
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Pero right now, ang naibigay lang po sa kanila is 2.7 million pesos.

asr-003502
04:24:47.100 --> 04:24:51.980
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Which I regret will not be able to have any substantial impact on the project.

asr-003503
04:24:52.120 --> 04:24:57.320
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And sayang kasi this property that is promised to us is between 800 to 1,000 square meters.

asr-003504
04:24:58.060 --> 04:25:02.400
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And this would have such a big impact on this town and in this part of the province.

asr-003505
04:25:02.880 --> 04:25:05.140
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Kung maitayutagan natin yung Bagong Pilipinas.

asr-003506
04:25:05.140 --> 04:25:05.520
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: So,

asr-003507
04:25:06.080 --> 04:25:11.360
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: I would like to request sana if this can be reviewed by our DOH.

asr-003508
04:25:11.980 --> 04:25:15.100
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: It was requested by the RDC of 19 million.

asr-003509
04:25:15.400 --> 04:25:17.540
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And we're really hoping that it can be reviewed again.

asr-003510
04:25:18.220 --> 04:25:21.140
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Para mas substantial, kahit phase one lang ba muna.

asr-003511
04:25:21.820 --> 04:25:23.820
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Mas substantial sana ang maibigay natin.

asr-003512
04:25:25.000 --> 04:25:28.340
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And so, of course, apart from this, we also have a few others.

asr-003513
04:25:28.440 --> 04:25:33.240
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: But maybe I will wait for our private conversation later, as you mentioned kanina, no?

asr-003514
04:25:33.240 --> 04:25:35.900
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Para we can discuss some more yung sa district namin.

asr-003515
04:25:36.080 --> 04:25:45.460
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And then, of course, I will defer to the questioning later of Congressman Erice when it comes to the mga maib, no?

asr-003516
04:25:45.520 --> 04:25:46.700
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Because that was quite interesting also.

asr-003517
04:25:46.760 --> 04:25:49.880
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: But I know that's going to be a long conversation, Madam Chair.

asr-003518
04:25:50.620 --> 04:25:53.980
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: So, I will end it at this.

asr-003519
04:25:54.420 --> 04:25:55.280
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Thank you very much.

asr-003520
04:25:55.400 --> 04:25:59.540
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And of course, just like what our Congressman earlier said also, Congressman Rufus,

asr-003521
04:25:59.840 --> 04:26:03.180
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: I do understand that you are being very stretched.

asr-003522
04:26:03.180 --> 04:26:05.960
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: There are so many requests coming at you.

asr-003523
04:26:06.080 --> 04:26:06.880
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: From all sides.

asr-003524
04:26:07.480 --> 04:26:13.660
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And rest assured that this representation will be very happy to support additional budget for the DOH.

asr-003525
04:26:13.900 --> 04:26:15.920
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Kasi talagang kailangan na kailangan punin niyo yan.

asr-003526
04:26:16.020 --> 04:26:17.980
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: And kailangan na kailangan ng ating taong bayan.

asr-003527
04:26:18.060 --> 04:26:21.400
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: So, please, rest assured of our support for the DOH.

asr-003528
04:26:22.280 --> 04:26:23.620
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-003529
04:26:24.100 --> 04:26:24.900
Rep. Audrey Kay T. Zubiri: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-003530
04:26:26.040 --> 04:26:27.760
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Kong Audrey.

asr-003531
04:26:28.620 --> 04:26:31.360
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: The next will be from the majority.

asr-003532
04:26:31.360 --> 04:26:33.560
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: D.S. Bambi Emano.

asr-003533
04:26:33.860 --> 04:26:34.640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Sir, you're recognized.

asr-003534
04:26:35.200 --> 04:26:35.680
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you.

asr-003535
04:26:36.080 --> 04:26:36.840
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-003536
04:26:37.240 --> 04:26:44.500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Mr. Secretary, I would like to reiterate the questions that I asked for the record during the consultation.

asr-003537
04:26:45.180 --> 04:26:52.100
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: May I know if you were able to browse through already with the RA 11721, the creation of NMGH?

asr-003538
04:26:54.770 --> 04:26:55.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, po.

asr-003539
04:26:55.430 --> 04:27:01.190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And I think we have some answers to the queries that were presented during the consultation, po.

asr-003540
04:27:01.730 --> 04:27:02.250
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Yeah.

asr-003541
04:27:02.650 --> 04:27:06.430
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The first question that I want to be placed on record is,

asr-003542
04:27:06.650 --> 04:27:07.690
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: may I know who chose the location?

asr-003543
04:27:07.710 --> 04:27:09.670
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: May I know who chose the location where the hospital should be built?

asr-003544
04:27:13.660 --> 04:27:22.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: We can, can I call on USEC, acting USEC SENA of our, ano ba ang tanya niya?

asr-003545
04:27:25.240 --> 04:27:28.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Health Facility Development Bureau.

asr-003546
04:27:28.920 --> 04:27:32.980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Acting ASEC SENA for Health Facility Development Bureau.

asr-003547
04:27:33.280 --> 04:27:34.060
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Yes, sir.

asr-003548
04:27:34.620 --> 04:27:38.400
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Is this the Northeastern Misamis Hospital, sir?

asr-003549
04:27:39.920 --> 04:27:41.080
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Northeastern, yes, ma'am.

asr-003550
04:27:41.080 --> 04:27:41.800
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Ah.

asr-003551
04:27:46.160 --> 04:27:53.680
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Sir, it was the House of Representatives that chose the location of the hospital.

asr-003552
04:27:54.400 --> 04:27:58.640
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I beg to disagree that it was the House of Representatives, Madam Chair.

asr-003553
04:28:01.130 --> 04:28:01.310
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Huh?

asr-003554
04:28:08.000 --> 04:28:16.160
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Madam Chair, if I may, usually the House of Representatives is not involved in selecting locations or whatsoever.

asr-003555
04:28:16.160 --> 04:28:21.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Our limitation is actually just on oversight powers and the budget process.

asr-003556
04:28:21.280 --> 04:28:23.660
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May I respectfully request?

asr-003557
04:28:23.740 --> 04:28:26.400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: That that statement be stricken off the records.

asr-003558
04:28:27.200 --> 04:28:29.200
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, DS Garin.

asr-003559
04:28:29.200 --> 04:28:32.640
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ah, this is, ah, noted and recorded.

asr-003560
04:28:34.180 --> 04:28:41.400
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ah, may we request ASEC, ah, SENA to verify the, the answer?

asr-003561
04:28:41.920 --> 04:28:45.880
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ah, to the question of Rep. Amano?

asr-003562
04:28:50.470 --> 04:28:56.930
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: The, the hospitals are, ah, used to be an extension of, ah, existing DOH hospital.

asr-003563
04:28:56.930 --> 04:29:02.690
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: And then it was enacted to be a separate and distinct hospital under the Department of Health.

asr-003564
04:29:03.410 --> 04:29:11.050
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I beg to disagree. It's a new hospital created under RA 11721.

asr-003565
04:29:17.430 --> 04:29:22.350
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: May I request, sir, that the regional director be recognized for the answer.

asr-003566
04:29:22.510 --> 04:29:23.630
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, if you will allow.

asr-003567
04:29:25.090 --> 04:29:31.490
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes, may we request the regional director, if he or she is present.

asr-003568
04:29:32.310 --> 04:29:42.500
DOH Officer-in-Charge Assistant Secretary Dr. Melissa T. Sena: Director Legaspi.

asr-003569
04:30:08.140 --> 04:30:16.440
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Kong Emano, while the regional director is being called, maybe we can park this question and then if you could proceed to your other question.

asr-003570
04:30:17.160 --> 04:30:20.400
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Yeah, it's a series of questions, Madam Chair, but Madam Chair, I can actually.

asr-003571
04:30:20.720 --> 04:30:30.460
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: May we ask Madam Chair if there's in any way that we can compel doctors to accept MAIFIP as a mode of payment for PF, Madam Chair?

asr-003572
04:30:30.460 --> 04:30:40.580
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Secretary, would we be able to reply with regards to the policy on MAIFIP on professional fees?

asr-003573
04:30:43.500 --> 04:30:50.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, Madam Chair, one of our amendments that we were proposing is to make it compulsory for doctors to accept.

asr-003574
04:30:52.060 --> 04:30:54.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: It's part of the GAD and it should be implemented.

asr-003575
04:30:55.680 --> 04:30:58.960
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Amendment to what, Madam Chair, if I may ask?

asr-003576
04:31:02.670 --> 04:31:03.730
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, time's running.

asr-003577
04:31:06.670 --> 04:31:15.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: It's a special provision, pardon me, it's not an amendment, but inclusion in the special provision of the GAA.

asr-003578
04:31:17.670 --> 04:31:22.950
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: You will include it as a special amendment to the GAA?

asr-003579
04:31:23.870 --> 04:31:27.310
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Am I right, Madam Chair? Is there a way to compel doctors to accept PF?

asr-003580
04:31:35.070 --> 04:31:39.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: We actually are starting to negotiate through the specialty societies.

asr-003581
04:31:42.010 --> 04:31:43.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But it's.

asr-003582
04:31:43.490 --> 04:32:13.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: It's optional, that's why part of our, if you want to really compel, it becomes part of the GAA, but currently we're already in talks with certain specialty groups like the Philippine College of Surgeons, Philippine Obstetrics and Gynecological Society, PCP, to come up with a PF scheme that would either be a multiple of whatever PhilHealth is covering or base it on the RVU code of the HMO.

asr-003583
04:32:13.490 --> 04:32:15.010
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: As basis for the PF.

asr-003584
04:32:15.490 --> 04:32:16.390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So it's standardized.

asr-003585
04:32:17.510 --> 04:32:19.670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But right now, we're still in talks.

asr-003586
04:32:20.970 --> 04:32:30.990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So if we will make it optional, then it should be a pre-negotiated PF structure.

asr-003587
04:32:32.290 --> 04:32:43.390
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Okay, Madam Chair, because I've been asking since 19th Congress and it seems that I did not get any concrete answer on how we'll be able to compel doctors to accept my EP.

asr-003588
04:32:43.490 --> 04:32:45.850
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: To pay for the PF, Madam Chair.

asr-003589
04:32:46.150 --> 04:32:55.690
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Hopefully, we will be, there will be a way that they'll be able to find it, to sign a memorandum of agreement or compel doctors to accept my EP as payment for PF, Madam Chair.

asr-003590
04:32:59.380 --> 04:33:00.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-003591
04:33:00.740 --> 04:33:04.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Actually, we are looking at packaging it together with the hospital.

asr-003592
04:33:04.340 --> 04:33:06.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: We will come up with an opt-in mechanism.

asr-003593
04:33:07.300 --> 04:33:16.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: In return, if you agree on this PF rate, it's the volume of patients that we will be directing to your hospital and to the hospital.

asr-003594
04:33:16.900 --> 04:33:19.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, we will come up with such.

asr-003595
04:33:20.820 --> 04:33:22.140
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: We'll be waiting, Madam Chair.

asr-003596
04:33:22.320 --> 04:33:24.500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Waiting since 19th Congress, Madam Chair.

asr-003597
04:33:24.660 --> 04:33:26.020
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And this is the 20th Congress already.

asr-003598
04:33:26.120 --> 04:33:27.900
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: But hopefully, there's a light at the end of the tunnel.

asr-003599
04:33:28.420 --> 04:33:32.320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, I need to follow up the questions that I have been asking about NMGH.

asr-003600
04:33:33.420 --> 04:33:34.000
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you.

asr-003601
04:33:34.100 --> 04:33:44.740
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: May we check if the Regional Director is already in the room to reply to the query of Representative D.S. Bambi?

asr-003618
04:34:21.980 --> 04:34:23.000
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Regional Director.

asr-003619
04:34:23.560 --> 04:34:32.140
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, at the same time, I have 3-3-3 minutes.

asr-003620
04:34:32.540 --> 04:34:38.980
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I'm willing to yield to another member until the Regional Director arrives and will be able to answer my question, Madam Chair.

asr-003621
04:34:39.540 --> 04:34:41.220
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you, Rep. Bambi.

asr-003622
04:34:41.700 --> 04:34:46.680
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: But, Madam Chair, after, when he arrives and after that member, Madam Chair, I will be able to continue.

asr-003623
04:34:46.680 --> 04:34:57.810
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Madam Chair, a very quick interjection in regards, with regards to the concern of the Honorable Bambi Emano,

asr-003624
04:34:58.330 --> 04:35:05.650
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: our Deputy Speaker and the Leader of Nationalista Party, while we're waiting for his Regional Director.

asr-003625
04:35:06.190 --> 04:35:13.170
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Madam Chair, if I may, and of course, Honorable Secretary Edwin Mercado, on the issue of doctor's fee, professional fee.

asr-003626
04:35:13.870 --> 04:35:19.170
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: And here is Usec Domingo, who has promised us since 2023,

asr-003627
04:35:19.170 --> 04:35:20.730
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: on the PF.

asr-003628
04:35:21.410 --> 04:35:28.730
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Since 2023, every year during budget deliberation, there was a commitment that within one month,

asr-003629
04:35:29.210 --> 04:35:32.910
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: the tarifa of our doctors will be produced by the Department of Health.

asr-003630
04:35:33.250 --> 04:35:40.230
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: I believe the other Usecs and Usecs and Directors here present can attest to that, and the records will also show that.

asr-003631
04:35:40.670 --> 04:35:45.110
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: In addition to that, there was also an agreement already, and it is in the guidelines,

asr-003632
04:35:45.330 --> 04:35:49.110
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: that 50% of the PF of doctors can be compensated.

asr-003633
04:35:49.330 --> 04:35:51.170
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: 50% of the PF of doctors can be covered by MAIFIP.

asr-003634
04:35:51.470 --> 04:35:54.470
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Do you remember? I see the Usecs saying yes.

asr-003635
04:35:54.670 --> 04:35:56.670
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So the agreement was this.

asr-003636
04:35:56.670 --> 04:35:59.930
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: 50% of their PF is covered by MAIFIP.

asr-003637
04:36:00.370 --> 04:36:06.510
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: However, what happened, that is what the D.S. Deputy Secretary Bambi Emano was trying to do.

asr-003638
04:36:06.510 --> 04:36:08.510
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The others, they increased the PF.

asr-003639
04:36:09.010 --> 04:36:10.610
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So it defeats the purpose.

asr-003640
04:36:10.610 --> 04:36:16.110
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: On top of that, they will accept the MAIF, and then, they will still protest outside.

asr-003641
04:36:16.110 --> 04:36:19.110
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So, what you are struggling with is disappearing.

asr-003642
04:36:19.590 --> 04:36:25.290
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So I reiterate, I believe Dr. President Beverly Ho is here.

asr-003643
04:36:25.590 --> 04:36:33.510
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: She might remember that sometime in 2015, there was an agreement between DOH and PhilHealth,

asr-003644
04:36:33.870 --> 04:36:36.670
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: when MAP, Medical Assistance, was started.

asr-003645
04:36:37.030 --> 04:36:41.270
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: It will have to be linked again to PhilHealth accreditation.

asr-003646
04:36:41.270 --> 04:36:48.370
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: You can start with a reprimand, then later on a suspension or a revocation of PhilHealth accreditation.

asr-003647
04:36:48.530 --> 04:36:49.030
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: If,

asr-003648
04:36:49.170 --> 04:36:57.330
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: specific doctor does that comply so ds bambi mano am i conveying your message loud and clear

asr-003649
04:36:59.510 --> 04:37:08.710
