DOH HHRDB Director IV Johanna Solon S. Banzon, RN, MScIH, DTMPH: Madam Chair, we do have scholarships. It is run by, DOH used to have what we call the pre-service scholarship programs. Nagpapaaral po tayo ng mga scholars sa medisina but that is already transitioning out dahil ang CHED po ang nagpapaaral na ngayon.

asr-004225
