asr-005465
05:59:18.040 --> 05:59:19.220
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: to see the same

asr-005466
05:59:19.220 --> 05:59:19.960
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: SOA

asr-005467
05:59:19.960 --> 05:59:21.540
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that is filed to us

asr-005468
05:59:21.540 --> 05:59:22.680
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: by the providers.

asr-005469
05:59:22.940 --> 05:59:23.980
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But it also entails

asr-005470
05:59:23.980 --> 05:59:25.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that our hospitals

asr-005471
05:59:25.240 --> 05:59:26.900
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: file ASAP,

asr-005472
05:59:27.100 --> 05:59:27.260
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: right?

asr-005473
05:59:27.360 --> 05:59:28.080
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi ngayon po,

asr-005474
05:59:28.240 --> 05:59:29.340
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: some hospitals file

asr-005475
05:59:29.340 --> 05:59:30.280
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: 20 days after

asr-005476
05:59:30.280 --> 05:59:31.500
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: ma-discharge yung patient.

asr-005477
05:59:31.760 --> 05:59:33.140
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So magkakaiba po kami

asr-005478
05:59:33.140 --> 05:59:33.980
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: ng nakikitang

asr-005479
05:59:33.980 --> 05:59:35.260
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: resibo,

asr-005480
05:59:35.420 --> 05:59:35.820
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kumbaga.

asr-005481
05:59:36.460 --> 05:59:38.600
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But yung one-stop shop

asr-005482
05:59:38.600 --> 05:59:39.540
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: in most of the

asr-005483
05:59:39.540 --> 05:59:40.720
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: DOH hospitals,

asr-005484
05:59:41.260 --> 05:59:43.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: like the Malahat Sakit Center

asr-005485
05:59:43.240 --> 05:59:44.020
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: or, yeah,

asr-005486
05:59:44.380 --> 05:59:45.420
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that is supposed

asr-005487
05:59:45.420 --> 05:59:47.040
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: to help the patients

asr-005488
05:59:47.040 --> 05:59:50.000
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: manage the whole

asr-005489
05:59:50.000 --> 05:59:51.220
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: healthcare expenditure.

asr-005490
05:59:52.900 --> 05:59:53.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi po,

asr-005491
05:59:54.260 --> 05:59:55.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the reason why I'm asking

asr-005492
05:59:55.800 --> 05:59:56.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: is because

asr-005493
05:59:56.360 --> 05:59:57.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: most of yung

asr-005494
05:59:57.880 --> 05:59:59.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nagri-reklamo po sa amin,

asr-005495
05:59:59.300 --> 06:00:00.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang nangyayari

asr-005496
06:00:00.320 --> 06:00:06.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sinasabi po sa kanila, pagka hindi nila ma-cover yung billing, maghanap kayo ng congressman, maghanap kayo ng senador.

asr-005497
06:00:06.640 --> 06:00:15.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Eh kayo naman po ang may hawak kasi nung MAIP. So bakit hindi na lang yung one-stop shop nga, o kayo na lang mag-coordinate kung kanino puwedeng humingi?

asr-005498
06:00:15.560 --> 06:00:26.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang nangyayari po, para silang ano eh, parang bumabalik sa dati na parang they have to look for congressmen and senators para lang makahingi ng assistance.

asr-005499
06:00:29.220 --> 06:00:38.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kawawa naman po yung pasyente, na sila na nga may sakit o kapamilya na nila may sakit, tapos maghahanap pa sila ng tagabayad.

asr-005500
06:00:39.020 --> 06:00:50.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So I hope we can strengthen the one-stop shop na wala na po silang problemahin. Isa na lang ang lalapitan nila and everything will be facilitated for them. Is that possible?

asr-005501
06:00:59.860 --> 06:01:05.160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, yun nga po yung contracting engagement na nais naming pasukin.

asr-005502
06:01:05.160 --> 06:01:18.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Combined with PhilHealth na pag nag-shift to global payment, yung mga outliers na hindi ordinarily na kukover ng PhilHealth, automatic may moa din po to cover yung maipip.

asr-005503
06:01:19.720 --> 06:01:27.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Tapos yung others na po na supposedly with PhilHealth and maipip, siguro substantially.

asr-005504
06:01:27.940 --> 06:01:29.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sek, pwede niyo po bang ilapit?

asr-005505
06:01:29.260 --> 06:01:35.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes po. So yun po yung part nung ano namin. Planong mag-join contract.

asr-005506
06:01:35.160 --> 06:01:47.920
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Contracting engagement with the hospitals. Na yung pong global payment, meron pong mga outliers na ang second layer naman ay maipip. So gagawin po namin yun ng sistema.

asr-005507
06:01:49.100 --> 06:02:03.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair, let me go to my next question. Paano dini-determine ng DOH po ang maipip allocation per region and hospital? May scientific formula ba based on poverty, population, disease burden, patient volume, utilization, and actual need?

asr-005508
06:02:04.080 --> 06:02:08.780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Can I call on

asr-005509
06:02:08.940 --> 06:02:10.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Usec Zhielah?

asr-005510
06:02:12.080 --> 06:02:12.700
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Go ahead po.

asr-005511
06:02:12.800 --> 06:02:25.200
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Madam Chair, the downloaded funds to the DOH hospitals, we determine the amounts based on the level of the hospitals.

asr-005512
06:02:25.200 --> 06:02:26.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you speak up? Pakilapit na po.

asr-005513
06:02:26.700 --> 06:02:29.820
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Based on the level of the hospitals and the absorptive capacity.

asr-005514
06:02:32.940 --> 06:02:39.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan po ang, if that's the case, ilan po ang maipip disbursement as of today?

asr-005515
06:02:39.820 --> 06:02:41.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi based on...

asr-005516
06:02:41.300 --> 06:02:56.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Your data, 61.3% po ang hindi na disperse. Or 61.3% ang actual disbursement rate ninyo for last year.

asr-005517
06:02:57.440 --> 06:03:12.010
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang hindi po natin na gastos is 41 billion. So kung may scientific basis po yan, yung 41 billion na sana na yan, sana nagamit na natin sa zero balance billing.

asr-005518
06:03:15.910 --> 06:03:25.590
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang dami pa rin hong, di ba, yung sinasabi ko kanina na yung ating out-of-pocket is around 44%.

asr-005519
06:03:25.590 --> 06:03:29.050
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na sana yung maipip na lang ho ang tumulong.

asr-005520
06:03:43.050 --> 06:03:44.390
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Madam Chair, the...

asr-005521
06:03:44.390 --> 06:03:45.590
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you speak up, please?

asr-005522
06:03:45.590 --> 06:03:50.650
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: The 50% obligation rate is actually the combined CONAP and GAA.

asr-005523
06:03:51.670 --> 06:03:53.590
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Pero ang aming po talagang...

asr-005524
06:03:54.730 --> 06:03:58.590
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Well, for 2026, the obligation rate...

asr-005525
06:03:59.130 --> 06:04:02.030
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: And the 50% and the disbursement rate is 70%.

asr-005526
06:04:02.030 --> 06:04:03.250
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I cannot hear you, ma'am.

asr-005527
06:04:04.630 --> 06:04:08.090
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sorry. Can you please speak into the mic?

asr-005528
06:04:17.960 --> 06:04:27.120
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Madam Chair, for year 2025, our obligation rate, updated obligation rate is actually 86%.

asr-005529
06:04:27.120 --> 06:04:30.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Again? Again, sorry.

asr-005530
06:04:30.240 --> 06:04:34.600
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: 86% po, including CONAP and...

asr-005531
06:04:34.600 --> 06:04:35.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When was this?

asr-005532
06:04:35.880 --> 06:04:38.000
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Ito po, 2025 po, updated.

asr-005533
06:04:38.560 --> 06:04:40.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So 86%?

asr-005534
06:04:40.040 --> 06:04:40.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 2025.

asr-005535
06:04:41.100 --> 06:04:41.400
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Ako.

asr-005536
06:04:42.000 --> 06:04:43.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 2026. Ilan na po tayo?

asr-005537
06:04:45.610 --> 06:04:51.150
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: So 2026 po, 50% because we're still waiting for the cash.

asr-005538
06:04:52.010 --> 06:04:53.450
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Notice of cash allocation.

asr-005539
06:04:54.150 --> 06:05:05.170
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Paano po kaya natin masisiguro na hindi nagiging palakasan yung pag-disburse, no?

asr-005540
06:05:05.670 --> 06:05:13.770
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For example, kami po sa bagong henerasyon, since 2025, sinabihan po kami na wala kaming maaring i-request.

asr-005541
06:05:14.070 --> 06:05:18.870
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na additional MyVIP allocation for hospitals, for patients referred to us.

asr-005542
06:05:19.730 --> 06:05:24.250
Rep. Roberto Nazal: While apparently, meron po mga ibang opisina that continue to receive allocations,

asr-005543
06:05:24.750 --> 06:05:29.410
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ano po ang objective basis kung sino ang nabibigyan at sino ang hindi?

asr-005544
06:05:29.410 --> 06:05:40.820
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: As far as the MyVIP program is concerned, all referred patients are assessed by the medical social worker.

asr-005545
06:05:41.300 --> 06:05:43.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sorry, ma'am. Can you please speak into the mic?

asr-005546
06:05:43.980 --> 06:05:48.060
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: All referred patients are assessed by the medical social worker.

asr-005547
06:05:48.140 --> 06:05:51.660
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: So yun po yung aming eligibility requirement.

asr-005548
06:05:55.360 --> 06:05:57.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Paano, ma'am? Can you repeat that?

asr-005549
06:05:58.380 --> 06:06:02.920
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: Yung pong kung sino nabibigyan, based on eligibility requirement,

asr-005550
06:06:03.820 --> 06:06:07.140
DOH Undersecretary Zhielah Ritz C. Gatchalian: na based din po sa assessment ng medical social workers.

asr-005551
06:06:08.400 --> 06:06:13.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can, can, Mr. Chair, can, Madam Chair, can we request DOH to submit before plenary

asr-005552
06:06:13.860 --> 06:06:20.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the complete MyVIP allocations for 2024, 2025, and 2026 by region, hospital, and health facility?

asr-005553
06:06:20.980 --> 06:06:26.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Including additional downloads, augmentations, utilization, patient-served, remaining balances,

asr-005554
06:06:27.500 --> 06:06:30.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and where applicable, requesting, or referring office.

asr-005555
06:06:32.580 --> 06:06:36.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Siguro, can I touch on one more?

asr-005556
06:06:36.820 --> 06:06:44.720
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Just a moment, Robert. So we're requesting DOH to please provide the data requested.

asr-005557
06:06:45.360 --> 06:06:48.080
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Please wrap up, Representative Nazal.

asr-005558
06:06:48.080 --> 06:06:49.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-005559
06:06:49.900 --> 06:06:50.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Under section...

asr-005560
06:06:50.980 --> 06:06:57.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Under section 29, Secretary, of the Universal Healthcare Act,

asr-005561
06:06:57.880 --> 06:07:04.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at least 10% of private hospital beds should be basic or wired accommodation

asr-005562
06:07:04.380 --> 06:07:06.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: where no balance billing applies.

asr-005563
06:07:07.220 --> 06:07:08.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Seven years na po ang batas.

asr-005564
06:07:09.060 --> 06:07:11.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nangyayari, nangyayari na ba talaga ito today?

asr-005565
06:07:11.500 --> 06:07:23.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa amin pong mga exit interviews sa mga LGU at saka DOH,

asr-005566
06:07:23.660 --> 06:07:23.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ang...

asr-005567
06:07:24.380 --> 06:07:26.060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: compliance rate po ay mataas.

asr-005568
06:07:26.140 --> 06:07:31.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa private po yung medyo mahirap po talagang i-monitor.

asr-005569
06:07:32.500 --> 06:07:34.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But yun nga po ang ginagawa namin.

asr-005570
06:07:34.800 --> 06:07:40.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nagkaka-prone na po kami ng parang contracting out.

asr-005571
06:07:42.580 --> 06:07:45.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nag-agree na kami doon sa coverage.

asr-005572
06:07:46.240 --> 06:07:50.820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At mag-shift na nga po tayo to global budget once we're done with the computation.

asr-005573
06:07:50.820 --> 06:07:54.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But Mr. Secretary, Madam Chair, the law is very clear.

asr-005574
06:07:54.380 --> 06:08:02.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Na dapat 10% po nung beds nila ay ina-allocate nila for no balance billing

asr-005575
06:08:02.080 --> 06:08:04.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: under the Universal Healthcare Act.

asr-005576
06:08:04.900 --> 06:08:09.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So bakit wala ba tayong clear guidelines to implement this?

asr-005577
06:08:09.500 --> 06:08:12.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And why are we not imposing this on private hospitals?

asr-005578
06:08:16.620 --> 06:08:19.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, we're starting to strengthen our monitoring po.

asr-005579
06:08:19.740 --> 06:08:23.400
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And since we already did an across the board 30 and 50,

asr-005580
06:08:23.400 --> 06:08:26.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: so it's practically 95 expansion of the Z-Bend,

asr-005581
06:08:27.100 --> 06:08:30.220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: we're really intent on implementing po.

asr-005582
06:08:30.640 --> 06:08:35.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So when can we expect the clear guidelines, Secretary, Madam Chair?

asr-005583
06:08:36.700 --> 06:08:37.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Within the year po.

asr-005584
06:08:40.080 --> 06:08:43.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Before the budget hearing ends, matatapos po natin yan?

asr-005585
06:08:43.420 --> 06:08:46.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And we will implement the law?

asr-005586
06:08:49.670 --> 06:08:50.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ongoing po.

asr-005587
06:08:50.490 --> 06:08:53.990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung license, pwede naman pong part yun nung licensing natin.

asr-005588
06:08:54.330 --> 06:08:58.990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi nga, kaya po start of year, gagamit na po natin as reason na...

asr-005589
06:08:59.850 --> 06:09:03.570
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So if they do not implement, di nila sinundan yung batas,

asr-005590
06:09:04.150 --> 06:09:05.570
Rep. Roberto Nazal: maapektuhan po yung lisensya nila.

asr-005591
06:09:06.490 --> 06:09:10.730
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair, and Mr. Secretary.

asr-005592
06:09:12.430 --> 06:09:14.170
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Doon, one last question.

asr-005593
06:09:14.790 --> 06:09:15.790
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Just one last question.

asr-005594
06:09:15.790 --> 06:09:16.330
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tatanungin ko lang po.

asr-005595
06:09:16.690 --> 06:09:21.610
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Doon po sa mga doktor na hindi po po mapayag na tumanggap sila ng

asr-005596
06:09:21.610 --> 06:09:28.550
Rep. Roberto Nazal: MyVip para sa, or GL para sa kanilang, ano, sa kanilang PF,

asr-005597
06:09:28.970 --> 06:09:29.770
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ano po?

asr-005598
06:09:29.850 --> 06:09:33.230
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang ginagawa natin para maayos po ito?

asr-005599
06:09:36.040 --> 06:09:41.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So for DOH and government, and LGU government po, required po talaga natanggapin.

asr-005600
06:09:41.820 --> 06:09:45.120
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Doon po naman sa mga private, kaya nabanggit ko kanina,

asr-005601
06:09:45.660 --> 06:09:51.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: we're already coordinating with the different specialty societies.

asr-005602
06:09:51.000 --> 06:09:57.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At least the four major ones, the PCS, College of Surgeons, Obstetrics and Gynecology,

asr-005603
06:09:58.300 --> 06:10:01.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: the Philippine College of Physicians, which are the internal medicine,

asr-005604
06:10:01.860 --> 06:10:04.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: and also the pediatrician, the PPS.

asr-005605
06:10:05.320 --> 06:10:07.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So we hope to also come up.

asr-005606
06:10:07.740 --> 06:10:10.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron na po kaming mga proposal na pininisent.

asr-005607
06:10:10.620 --> 06:10:15.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: It could be patterned after the HMO as a multiple of the RVU, na may multiplier,

asr-005608
06:10:15.960 --> 06:10:19.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: or a percentage of what PhilHealth currently is covering.

asr-005609
06:10:20.120 --> 06:10:25.720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So we're negotiating na po, or we're already coordinating and collaborating with them po.

asr-005610
06:10:25.800 --> 06:10:26.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano ho bang problema?

asr-005611
06:10:27.020 --> 06:10:30.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is it case rate or mabagal ang bayad pagka ano?

asr-005612
06:10:31.000 --> 06:10:31.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pagka?

asr-005613
06:10:31.860 --> 06:10:32.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: G.L.

asr-005614
06:10:33.500 --> 06:10:36.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit ho ba nagiging hesitant yung mga doktor?

asr-005615
06:10:37.620 --> 06:10:40.360
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: I think it's a factor of both.

asr-005616
06:10:40.760 --> 06:10:42.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But kasi nga, they say,

asr-005617
06:10:43.420 --> 06:10:47.480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mamarkup ako kasi cost of money, kasi matagal kayo magbayad.

asr-005618
06:10:47.540 --> 06:10:49.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Which I was able to solve in PhilHealth.

asr-005619
06:10:49.580 --> 06:10:52.980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ngayon, with payment in 15 days, di na nila marason yun.

asr-005620
06:10:53.560 --> 06:10:59.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya tinitingnan nga namin na yung mga EFIP ay maging parang global payment na front-loaded,

asr-005621
06:11:00.020 --> 06:11:01.580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kahit man virtual, para mabilis.

asr-005622
06:11:01.860 --> 06:11:03.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Mabilis yung reimbursement.

asr-005623
06:11:03.440 --> 06:11:05.860
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun po yung ginagawa natin na sistema.

asr-005624
06:11:06.420 --> 06:11:11.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para mas makapag-negotiate tayo at makapag-engage po ng mga doktor.

asr-005625
06:11:11.640 --> 06:11:15.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And then, kung sila po ay sasali, ang opt-in nun,

asr-005626
06:11:16.260 --> 06:11:21.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mas makakapag-refer po tayo ng volume sa kung sino man po yung mag-i-engage ng mga private doctors.

asr-005627
06:11:22.820 --> 06:11:24.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi ho ba pwedeng,

asr-005628
06:11:24.200 --> 06:11:26.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hindi ho ba pwedeng ano,

asr-005629
06:11:27.600 --> 06:11:31.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: yung kanilang accreditation sa PhilHealth ay mawala kung hindi sila tatanggap?

asr-005630
06:11:33.910 --> 06:11:39.030
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yun din, kagaya po ng licensing ng mga hospital, pwede pong pag-usapan natin.

asr-005631
06:11:39.670 --> 06:11:43.590
