PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Siguro po,

asr-007725
07:49:32.440 --> 07:49:34.620
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: part din ng mga reasons is

asr-007726
07:49:34.620 --> 07:49:36.400
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: wala rin naman po talagang

asr-007727
07:49:36.400 --> 07:49:39.120
