asr-007735
07:49:54.320 --> 07:49:56.140
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: bumilis na po yung reimbursement

asr-007736
07:49:56.140 --> 07:49:57.760
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: time namin.

asr-007737
07:49:58.220 --> 07:50:00.680
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Ngayon po, is nasa 19 days na po.

asr-007738
07:50:01.320 --> 07:50:03.100
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Siguro yung other challenge na lang po

asr-007739
07:50:03.100 --> 07:50:05.100
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: is we also get reports that

asr-007740
07:50:05.100 --> 07:50:06.480
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: some hospitals,

asr-007741
07:50:06.680 --> 07:50:09.200
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: because we pay private hospitals in full,

asr-007742
07:50:09.720 --> 07:50:11.620
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: both the facility fee

asr-007743
07:50:11.620 --> 07:50:13.520
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: and the provider fee.

asr-007744
07:50:14.220 --> 07:50:14.900
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yung iba, may,

asr-007745
07:50:14.900 --> 07:50:16.100
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: may select cases po

asr-007746
07:50:16.100 --> 07:50:17.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: na some of the hospitals

asr-007747
07:50:17.240 --> 07:50:19.360
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: don't give the payment immediately

asr-007748
07:50:19.360 --> 07:50:20.240
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: to the physicians.

asr-007749
07:50:20.240 --> 07:50:23.040
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, yung iba pong hospital,

asr-007750
07:50:23.300 --> 07:50:25.040
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: once they get the payments from PhilHealth,

asr-007751
07:50:25.120 --> 07:50:27.820
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: di po nila agad binabalik sa mga doktor.

asr-007752
07:50:28.460 --> 07:50:30.420
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, may ganon din po kaming issue na

asr-007753
07:50:30.420 --> 07:50:33.160
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: we have reiterated the policies already

asr-007754
07:50:33.160 --> 07:50:35.160
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: but we might need to be

asr-007755
07:50:35.160 --> 07:50:37.080
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: a little bit more stern about it

asr-007756
07:50:37.080 --> 07:50:37.900
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kasi, syempre,

asr-007757
07:50:38.360 --> 07:50:40.520
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: at a disadvantage na rin po yung mga doktor.

asr-007758
07:50:40.660 --> 07:50:43.280
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Some doctors are receiving their reimbursements

asr-007759
07:50:43.280 --> 07:50:44.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: six months or even more.

asr-007760
07:50:44.900 --> 07:50:45.820
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Even a year after,

asr-007761
07:50:46.040 --> 07:50:47.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: we have already paid the hospital.

asr-007762
07:50:48.260 --> 07:50:51.060
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, kailangan din po na may disiplina din po doon.

asr-007763
07:50:51.200 --> 07:50:53.120
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Do you have a mechanism to actually enforce that?

asr-007764
07:50:53.480 --> 07:50:55.140
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: To make sure that they are paid promptly?

asr-007765
07:50:55.640 --> 07:50:56.720
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Well, syempre po, no,

asr-007766
07:50:56.720 --> 07:50:58.860
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: it's a violation of their warranties

asr-007767
07:50:58.860 --> 07:51:00.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: of accreditation sa amin.

asr-007768
07:51:00.740 --> 07:51:03.420
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Pero, we also have to be honest na

asr-007769
07:51:03.420 --> 07:51:05.140
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: we also need the hospitals.

asr-007770
07:51:05.320 --> 07:51:06.300
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Di ba? In certain areas,

asr-007771
07:51:06.600 --> 07:51:09.040
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kahit kung itanggalan namin sila ng accreditation,

asr-007772
07:51:09.720 --> 07:51:11.440
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kawawa din naman yung members natin.

asr-007773
07:51:11.540 --> 07:51:12.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Walang pupuntahan, no?

asr-007774
07:51:12.580 --> 07:51:14.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, it's really working,

asr-007775
07:51:14.900 --> 07:51:15.360
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: working on,

asr-007776
07:51:15.940 --> 07:51:18.420
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: I guess, a punishment

asr-007777
07:51:18.420 --> 07:51:19.960
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that's commensurate,

asr-007778
07:51:20.460 --> 07:51:21.440
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that's painful enough,

asr-007779
07:51:21.520 --> 07:51:23.600
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: but also will not compromise access

asr-007780
07:51:23.600 --> 07:51:24.640
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: for our patients.

asr-007781
07:51:24.760 --> 07:51:27.000
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So, you have the response for that?

asr-007782
07:51:27.600 --> 07:51:28.940
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yes, we're working on that, po.

asr-007783
07:51:29.000 --> 07:51:30.900
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Okay. Then, the other thing is that,

asr-007784
07:51:31.600 --> 07:51:32.300
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: do I take it,

asr-007785
07:51:32.920 --> 07:51:34.020
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: is my assumption correct

asr-007786
07:51:34.020 --> 07:51:37.180
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: that unless the healthcare cost

asr-007787
07:51:37.180 --> 07:51:37.800
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: is standardized,

asr-007788
07:51:38.480 --> 07:51:40.780
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: let's say through the implementation of DRG,

asr-007789
07:51:41.720 --> 07:51:42.800
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: that the professionals,

asr-007790
07:51:42.800 --> 07:51:44.080
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: the medical professionals, doctors,

asr-007791
07:51:44.900 --> 07:51:47.080
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: have little incentive to actually join the program?

asr-007792
07:51:53.880 --> 07:51:54.780
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Madam Chair,

asr-007793
07:51:55.720 --> 07:51:59.020
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: yes, we need the DRGs

asr-007794
07:51:59.020 --> 07:52:00.800
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: so that there will be modifiers.

asr-007795
07:52:01.140 --> 07:52:04.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Meaning, if they're seeing a more difficult case,

asr-007796
07:52:04.660 --> 07:52:06.020
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: they can get paid higher.

asr-007797
07:52:06.220 --> 07:52:08.200
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi ngayon po, under PhilHealth rates,

asr-007798
07:52:08.380 --> 07:52:09.360
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: everything is standard.

asr-007799
07:52:09.740 --> 07:52:10.700
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: As mentioned earlier,

asr-007800
07:52:10.880 --> 07:52:13.220
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: parang if a patient is young and healthy

asr-007801
07:52:13.220 --> 07:52:16.100
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: with the same diagnosis as someone

asr-007802
07:52:16.100 --> 07:52:20.020
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: who has super many multi-morbid conditions,

asr-007803
07:52:20.440 --> 07:52:22.500
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: we are paying them the same thing.

asr-007804
07:52:22.680 --> 07:52:25.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Ergo, their PF are also supposedly the same.

asr-007805
07:52:26.040 --> 07:52:28.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, with the DRGs po, may modifier.

asr-007806
07:52:29.060 --> 07:52:30.300
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, tataas din po, no?

asr-007807
07:52:30.360 --> 07:52:32.460
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kung mas complicated yung cases na makita nila.

asr-007808
07:52:32.580 --> 07:52:35.480
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, in a way, they can be compensated

asr-007809
07:52:35.480 --> 07:52:36.900
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: and incentivized.

asr-007810
07:52:37.380 --> 07:52:39.500
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But, tama naman po kayo na

asr-007811
07:52:39.500 --> 07:52:40.640
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: yung primary pa rin po

asr-007812
07:52:40.640 --> 07:52:42.320
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: is dapat magbayad kami ng maaga,

asr-007813
07:52:42.700 --> 07:52:43.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: ng mabilis,

asr-007814
07:52:43.900 --> 07:52:46.080
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: at magbayad din po yung hospital sa kanila

asr-007815
07:52:46.080 --> 07:52:47.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: ng mabilis, in turn.

asr-007816
07:52:47.860 --> 07:52:48.980
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Matagal na po na problema yan,

asr-007817
07:52:48.980 --> 07:52:49.880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: pero yung, yung,

asr-007818
07:52:49.880 --> 07:52:50.760
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: yung prompt payment.

asr-007819
07:52:50.940 --> 07:52:52.260
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Sana po, magawa ng paraan

asr-007820
07:52:52.260 --> 07:52:55.000
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: para masagot na yung professional fees.

asr-007821
07:52:55.460 --> 07:52:56.160
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: But the other question,

asr-007822
07:52:56.240 --> 07:52:57.680
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: going back to DRG is,

asr-007823
07:52:58.440 --> 07:53:00.220
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: tama po ba in other systems,

asr-007824
07:53:00.420 --> 07:53:01.280
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: in other countries,

asr-007825
07:53:01.480 --> 07:53:03.640
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: that is the gold standard in DRG?

asr-007826
07:53:04.640 --> 07:53:07.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Yes, it's DRG as the basis for calculation.

asr-007827
07:53:08.180 --> 07:53:10.560
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And then, the global budget is the next part po,

asr-007828
07:53:10.620 --> 07:53:12.040
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: which si Sec Edwin was mentioning.

asr-007829
07:53:12.180 --> 07:53:14.720
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Meaning, some part of the reimbursement

asr-007830
07:53:14.720 --> 07:53:16.800
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: is already front-loaded to the hospital.

asr-007831
07:53:16.800 --> 07:53:19.720
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, it's like giving them a budget early on,

asr-007832
07:53:19.880 --> 07:53:23.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: meaning, there's no excuse already for the providers

asr-007833
07:53:23.380 --> 07:53:26.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: not to pay the doctors on time.

asr-007834
07:53:26.380 --> 07:53:28.580
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But also, it's more predictable.

asr-007835
07:53:28.580 --> 07:53:31.180
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi, since we know that a certain hospital,

asr-007836
07:53:31.180 --> 07:53:32.980
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: for example, is supposed to see,

asr-007837
07:53:32.980 --> 07:53:36.680
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: or is supposed to operate on 100 appendectomy cases,

asr-007838
07:53:36.680 --> 07:53:39.980
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: then, they can also contract their doctors and say,

asr-007839
07:53:39.980 --> 07:53:42.980
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: dahil magbibigay kami sa'yo ng 20 per month,

asr-007840
07:53:42.980 --> 07:53:45.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: then siguro, kaya mong babaan yung rate mo

asr-007841
07:53:45.880 --> 07:53:47.440
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kasi may guaranteed volume ka.

asr-007842
07:53:47.440 --> 07:53:49.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, this is like really how we want to,

asr-007843
07:53:49.880 --> 07:53:51.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: how we want to design the system moving forward.

asr-007844
07:53:51.880 --> 07:53:55.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi, syempre, the doctors are also breadwinners, di ba?

asr-007845
07:53:55.880 --> 07:53:58.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Hindi naman pwedeng late din nila ma-receive lahat nung bayad nila.

asr-007846
07:53:58.880 --> 07:54:05.880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Yung DRG po, pinag-uutos ng universal healthcare law, tama?

asr-007847
07:54:05.880 --> 07:54:08.880
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Pero, anong status doon? Kailan po marorollout yan?

asr-007848
07:54:09.880 --> 07:54:13.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, a lot of work has already been done by PhilHealth

asr-007849
07:54:13.880 --> 07:54:18.880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: under Sec Edwin, and also our partner research agency, PIDS,

asr-007850
07:54:18.880 --> 07:54:19.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: which is the PIDS.

asr-007851
07:54:19.380 --> 07:54:20.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: which is under NEDA.

asr-007852
07:54:20.380 --> 07:54:24.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, they're the research entity doing all of the work for DRG.

asr-007853
07:54:24.380 --> 07:54:30.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, hopefully, sir, we can pilot some version of the DRG already next year

asr-007854
07:54:30.380 --> 07:54:35.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: kasi marami ng consultations already with providers and hospitals this year.

asr-007855
07:54:35.380 --> 07:54:40.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Training is actually also ongoing for some of the hospitals

asr-007856
07:54:40.380 --> 07:54:44.380
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: that have signified interest na willing sila to be pilots.

asr-007857
07:54:44.380 --> 07:54:48.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Kung, Secretary, kung mapapa,

asr-007858
07:54:48.380 --> 07:54:52.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: kung masasagot nyo yung problema na yun, yung professional fees,

asr-007859
07:54:52.380 --> 07:54:54.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: yan po yung legacy ninyo.

asr-007860
07:54:54.380 --> 07:54:58.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Kasi sa Lalawigan po, sa probinsya, yan po talaga dayin ng mga tao eh.

asr-007861
07:54:58.380 --> 07:54:59.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: NGL.

asr-007862
07:54:59.380 --> 07:55:03.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Now, we can apply it towards paying the hospital bills,

asr-007863
07:55:03.380 --> 07:55:05.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: but not the professional fees.

asr-007864
07:55:05.380 --> 07:55:08.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: So, that would be a big, I think, a lasting legacy.

asr-007865
07:55:08.380 --> 07:55:10.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And people will be thankful for that.

asr-007866
07:55:10.380 --> 07:55:12.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Last question.

asr-007867
07:55:13.380 --> 07:55:17.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Mental health is a community-based approach.

asr-007868
07:55:17.380 --> 07:55:19.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Paano nyo pinapatupad to?

asr-007869
07:55:19.380 --> 07:55:24.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Kasi last week lang po, meron nung dalawang, actually in the last two weeks,

asr-007870
07:55:24.380 --> 07:55:34.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: meron dalawang pamilya na meron mga teenager na nagbigte in my district.

asr-007871
07:55:34.380 --> 07:55:37.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And I know that the approach is community-based.

asr-007872
07:55:37.380 --> 07:55:45.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: You know, in other words, imparting to non-licensed individuals

asr-007873
07:55:45.380 --> 07:55:49.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: aspects of mental health care that can be imparted.

asr-007874
07:55:50.380 --> 07:55:52.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: What is the status of that?

asr-007875
07:55:52.380 --> 07:55:55.380
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: And how do you monitor that that's being done?

asr-007876
07:55:58.380 --> 07:56:05.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, ang una nga po diyan, dahil po may kakulangan talaga po ng mga mental health professionals.

asr-007877
07:56:05.380 --> 07:56:12.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, ang atin pong gagawin ay mag-deploy o mag-deputize ng iba pa pong mga training centers

asr-007878
07:56:12.380 --> 07:56:14.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para po mag-certify ng mental health professionals.

asr-007879
07:56:15.380 --> 07:56:24.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pangalwa po ay paigtingin po yung peer-to-peer program dahil po,

asr-007880
07:56:24.380 --> 07:56:34.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: karamihan po talaga mas nakikinig kapag ka-peer, ka-ano niya, ka-edad.

asr-007881
07:56:34.380 --> 07:56:38.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang payo nga po sa amin nung ako ay nasa med school,

asr-007882
07:56:38.380 --> 07:56:44.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pag nakonbinsi mo isang nagtangka at nag-verbalize na sila ay mag-suicide,

asr-007883
07:56:44.380 --> 07:56:50.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at nakuha mo na verbally din sabihin huwag mong ituloy, malaki po ang chance na hindi tutuloy.

asr-007884
07:56:50.380 --> 07:56:53.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yung peer-to-peer po is very important.

asr-007885
07:56:53.380 --> 07:56:58.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pangatlo na po yung doon sa ating contact center na 24x7.

asr-007886
07:56:58.380 --> 07:57:07.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun lang medyo kailangan dagdagan siguro yung mga available share natin.

asr-007887
07:57:07.380 --> 07:57:11.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yung suicide surveillance po is very important.

asr-007888
07:57:11.380 --> 07:57:13.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pag may mga nakikita na po,

asr-007889
07:57:13.380 --> 07:57:20.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung kanilang mga peer na medyo meron pong mga actuation o nab-verbalize,

asr-007890
07:57:20.380 --> 07:57:25.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yun po yung pinaka-signalis po na baka magtuloy.

asr-007891
07:57:25.380 --> 07:57:32.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya yun po yung ating setting-based impanelment ng mental health ay sa school-based nga po,

asr-007892
07:57:32.380 --> 07:57:35.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na i-align natin with YACAP.

asr-007893
07:57:35.380 --> 07:57:43.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Secretary. Thank you very much, Kong Tony.

asr-007894
07:57:43.540 --> 07:57:46.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Just a reminder po sa ating lahat,

asr-007895
07:57:47.540 --> 07:57:51.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: at 6 o'clock po, we will take a 15-minute health break.

asr-007896
07:57:51.540 --> 07:57:54.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, we have 30 minutes more.

asr-007897
07:57:54.540 --> 07:58:02.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, we request po our members to please make our questions concise,

asr-007898
07:58:02.540 --> 07:58:06.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: and hopefully we don't repeat earlier questions already asked.

asr-007899
07:58:06.540 --> 07:58:12.540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Next on deck po is Representative Caroline Aguiao. Go ahead, ma'am.

asr-007900
07:58:12.540 --> 07:58:16.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you, Madam Chair. Good afternoon to DOH family.

asr-007901
07:58:16.540 --> 07:58:29.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Good afternoon po. Madam Chair, katangungan ko lang po sa nutrition program ng ating DOH.

asr-007902
07:58:29.540 --> 07:58:37.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Magkano po kaya yung continuing yung mga budget po natin for the stunting and wasting?

asr-007903
07:58:37.540 --> 07:58:43.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, ano po yung appropriate na-allocate for 2026?

asr-007904
07:58:43.540 --> 07:58:49.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, ano po yung how much is the budget for 2027?

asr-007905
07:58:49.540 --> 07:59:00.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, sa atin po, can we give us the exact number of children currently stunted at saka wasted for 2025-2026?

asr-007906
07:59:00.540 --> 07:59:10.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, how much po ang binibigay natin ka-perahan sa each beneficiary for this program?

asr-007907
07:59:10.540 --> 07:59:18.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: I know that the DOH, sinesentro po natin ang programa para sa mga children 0 to 59 months.

asr-007908
07:59:18.540 --> 07:59:24.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And of course, for our nutrition program, we have also the pregnant women and then the lactated mothers.

asr-007909
07:59:24.540 --> 07:59:28.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, ano po yung ginagawa po nating programa sa ngayon?

asr-007910
07:59:28.540 --> 07:59:38.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And sapat ho ba ang pondo po natin for ano po yung natitira for 2026 and sa 2027?

asr-007911
07:59:38.540 --> 07:59:45.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Na naka-allocate sa NEP po natin, okay na ba po ba yan? Salamat po.

asr-007912
07:59:45.540 --> 07:59:57.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Thank you po. Madam Chair, ang ating prevalence of stunting noong 2025 ay 25.3%.

asr-007913
07:59:57.640 --> 07:59:59.640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ngayon po...

asr-007914
08:00:00.000 --> 08:00:09.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 2026 dahil ongoing pa rin po. Ang target po namin ay maibaba ng 20.8 pero hintayin pa po natin until end of year kung ano po yung accomplishment rate natin.

asr-007915
08:00:10.300 --> 08:00:16.420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At for 2027 po ay 19.4% po ang ating target na reduction ng stunting.

asr-007916
08:00:16.420 --> 08:00:39.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ating budget for nutrition in the 2025 ga is 976 million. Yung nga lang po bumaba tayo ng 2026 ng 223 million at ngayon din po 2027 ay may trend po ng pababa ng another 209 million.

asr-007917
08:00:40.080 --> 08:00:45.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang ating sinestrengthen ay yung first 1000 day program po together with DSW.

asr-007918
08:00:46.420 --> 08:00:58.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: With PhilHealth. Kasi kasama na po dito yung dun pa lang sa prenatal na mamonitor na natin kasi nga po yung MCP natin kasama na yung 14, 14 nga ba?

asr-007919
08:00:58.200 --> 08:01:14.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang prenatal. Yun pong 8 prenatal visits na kasama po yung monitoring ng growth rate po ng ating intrauterine yung ating bata.

asr-007920
08:01:14.520 --> 08:01:15.520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At pagkatapos.

asr-007921
08:01:16.420 --> 08:01:25.320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At pagkatapos nga po ay after delivery which is still covered substantially by PhilHealth for postnatal for postpartum.

asr-007922
08:01:26.120 --> 08:01:43.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And maganda po yung mungkahi kanina ni Governor nung itahi din pati po yung family planning at saka lactation during the, bakit kasi yung for postnatal parang isang buwan at kalahati lang po eh parang maigse.

asr-007923
08:01:43.600 --> 08:01:45.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun dun po ay kakabalik.

asr-007924
08:01:46.420 --> 08:01:49.880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sabit natin yung monitoring ng first 1000 day.

asr-007925
08:01:50.020 --> 08:01:53.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pati yung lactating mother pa paano po yung ating tulong na gagawin.

asr-007926
08:01:54.420 --> 08:02:10.460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun pong sa first 1000 day naman sa PhilHealth ay meron pong mga nutritional program na kasama yung RUTF at saka yung mga high protein diets na kinukover naman po ng ating PhilHealth program.

asr-007927
08:02:13.480 --> 08:02:13.940
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you.

asr-007928
08:02:13.980 --> 08:02:15.040
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you Madam Chair.

asr-007929
08:02:15.040 --> 08:02:17.040
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat.

asr-007930
08:02:18.720 --> 08:02:32.500
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding din po sa ating procurement sa human anti-rabies vaccines and the rabies immunoglobulin under the national rabies program natin, prevention and control program.

asr-007931
08:02:33.300 --> 08:02:34.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung ginagawa po natin?

asr-007932
08:02:34.840 --> 08:02:39.760
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Is it the DOH procuring the vaccines?

asr-007933
08:02:40.780 --> 08:02:43.660
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then magkano po yung inaalat po natin dito?

asr-007934
08:02:43.780 --> 08:02:45.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then sufficient po ba ito?

asr-007935
08:02:45.960 --> 08:02:47.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi I think it's...

asr-007936
08:02:48.720 --> 08:02:52.580
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: For the first dose, yun po yung libre.

asr-007937
08:02:53.440 --> 08:03:11.240
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then yung succeeding doses na binibigay sa mga pasyente, yun po nasusubsidize or free din po yun na binibigay ng DOH or the LGU will be the one na procure the vaccines po.

asr-007938
08:03:11.240 --> 08:03:19.910
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So meron po tayong 747 million na nakalaan po sa anti-rabies vaccine and immunoglobulin.

asr-007939
08:03:20.390 --> 08:03:27.730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Covered po natin dito yung Category 2 and Category 3 animal bite.

asr-007940
08:03:28.330 --> 08:03:32.430
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong full dose na vaccination is already covered.

asr-007941
08:03:33.110 --> 08:03:33.270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Diba?

asr-007942
08:03:33.450 --> 08:03:34.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hanggang ilan yan?

asr-007943
08:03:34.950 --> 08:03:35.670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Three doses?

asr-007944
08:03:36.410 --> 08:03:40.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hanggang three doses po, yun po yung completed dose.

asr-007945
08:03:40.970 --> 08:03:42.390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But only...

asr-007946
08:03:43.590 --> 08:03:49.390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong Category 2 at Category 3 na nababakunahan.

asr-007947
08:03:50.390 --> 08:03:55.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung po ay pumapatak lang po nung almost 30% of all projected animal bites.

asr-007948
08:03:55.510 --> 08:03:58.830
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So meron pa rin po talagang hindi natin na kukover.

asr-007949
08:03:59.450 --> 08:04:05.270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron naman po tayong animal bite center ng PhilHealth na siya pong nagkukover.

asr-007950
08:04:05.350 --> 08:04:05.790
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun lang po.

asr-007951
08:04:05.970 --> 08:04:08.970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang covered ng PhilHealth ay only Category 3.

asr-007952
08:04:09.750 --> 08:04:11.670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hindi pa po covered yung Category 2.

asr-007953
08:04:11.890 --> 08:04:20.370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang public health intervention pong aming minumungkahi at mas tingin po namin mas cost effective ay bakunahan po yung ating pet.

asr-007954
08:04:20.910 --> 08:04:30.150
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Na yun po ay dapat din ma-isama sa budget po ng Department of Agriculture at saka yung iba pong local government units.

asr-007955
08:04:30.690 --> 08:04:35.310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi mas gagastos po tayo at tumataas po.

asr-007956
08:04:35.450 --> 08:04:40.110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nasa top three utilization po ng PhilHealth ang animal bite.

asr-007957
08:04:41.330 --> 08:04:44.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: May pag-uusap na pong i-cover yung Category 2.

asr-007958
08:04:44.250 --> 08:04:50.250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero dahil nga po nagkulang yung ating budget, medyo hindi po namin maipag-uusap.

asr-007959
08:04:50.390 --> 08:04:53.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: May roll out yung coverage ng Category 2 ng PhilHealth.

asr-007960
08:04:54.010 --> 08:04:59.310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ang ano po namin talagang yung mga animal at saka yung pets po ang mabakunahan.

asr-007961
08:05:00.190 --> 08:05:13.170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So Madam Chair, siguro doon sa DA para yung preventive measure, mas malaki kasi yung gasto sa gobyerno pag bumibili talaga tayo ng bakuna para sa mga, eto mga rabies sa mga ano natin, vaccines.

asr-007962
08:05:13.170 --> 08:05:19.230
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So siguro Madam Chair, doon sa DA, the vaccination of the pets.

asr-007963
08:05:19.230 --> 08:05:25.270
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Tapos dapat yun po ang isang popundahan po natin aside from this program sa DOH.

asr-007964
08:05:25.790 --> 08:05:28.470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-007965
08:05:28.870 --> 08:05:47.290
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding doon din po sa mga NIP natin, sa the National Immunization Program for the DOH, yung routine vaccines po natin, until now yung OPV, the Penta, and then the PCV, until now po hanggang ngayon is stuck out pa rin.

asr-007966
08:05:47.610 --> 08:05:49.190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So it will really affect.

asr-007967
08:05:49.230 --> 08:05:53.790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: It will really affect yung fully immunized children po natin.

asr-007968
08:05:54.690 --> 08:05:57.450
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung gagawin as the new secretary po?

asr-007969
08:05:57.550 --> 08:05:59.390
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung gagawin po natin for this?

asr-007970
08:05:59.390 --> 08:06:06.850
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: I know sabi nyo kanina may mga na-bead na po and then nag-go na-beading.

asr-007971
08:06:08.010 --> 08:06:10.450
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Hanggang kailan po kayo itong shortage na to?

asr-007972
08:06:10.610 --> 08:06:17.310
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then yun nga sabi ni Kong Green kanina na naglalakad na yung mababakunahan dapat.

asr-007973
08:06:18.110 --> 08:06:18.290
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So.

asr-007974
08:06:19.230 --> 08:06:21.910
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair, SEC, ano po yung kasagutan?

asr-007975
08:06:24.370 --> 08:06:26.970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, yung Penta-Valent na approved na po.

asr-007976
08:06:27.170 --> 08:06:28.590
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito gagalaw na po.

asr-007977
08:06:29.410 --> 08:06:34.470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hopefully nga ma-deliver natin before end of the year, by October or November.

asr-007978
08:06:35.390 --> 08:06:45.970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung MRC po, we are already doing the boosting of the missile ramps, missile mumps, yung tiglas hangin at tiglas.

asr-007979
08:06:47.370 --> 08:06:50.850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung gagawin nga po namin ay early procurement.

asr-007980
08:06:50.990 --> 08:06:54.770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: In anticipation nga po nung kailangan natin ng lead time.

asr-007981
08:06:54.950 --> 08:07:08.350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero at least yung 2026 na procured na po natin ngayong last week ko lang po na pirmahan para ma-deliver na nga by in 30 days to 45 days.

asr-007982
08:07:09.030 --> 08:07:10.790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Okay. Thank you, SEC. Madam Chair.

asr-007983
08:07:11.190 --> 08:07:18.690
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding po kasi sa mga vaccines po natin, di ba meron po tayong mga tinatanggap na mga donations na vaccines?

asr-007984
08:07:18.690 --> 08:07:19.690
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Hindi ba over...

asr-007985
08:07:20.990 --> 08:07:27.250
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung mga vaccine na pondo po natin na naka-allot for DOH, na-add po ba?

asr-007986
08:07:27.390 --> 08:07:36.810
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi di ba dito sa mga nagagaling sa mga CHD natin na mga mababakunahan na mga bata, nako-compute na po yun.

asr-007987
08:07:37.190 --> 08:07:44.490
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So monthly, sana continuous na po yung supply ng ating mga bakuna.

asr-007988
08:07:44.490 --> 08:07:50.830
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, yung next po ay yung mga NCD meds po.

asr-007989
08:07:50.830 --> 08:07:58.570
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So natin, Madam Chair, yung mga NCD kasi until now, na-stop na ho ba?

asr-007990
08:07:58.770 --> 08:08:10.330
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi ito yung malaking, malaki pong tulong sa ating mga LGUs, not only the LGUs, especially sa ating mga IPs, mga GIDA areas,

asr-007991
08:08:10.330 --> 08:08:18.590
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: na kung saan yung mga pasyente, nanggagaling pa sa kabundukan sa mga islands, para lang pumunta, bumiliin ng mga NCD,

asr-007992
08:08:18.710 --> 08:08:20.810
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: mga gamot nila.

asr-007993
08:08:20.830 --> 08:08:23.870
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: For the hypertension, alam na nila.

asr-007994
08:08:24.630 --> 08:08:33.030
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, we all know that the isang mortality, mataas na mortality now, is for 2026, it's all the NCD cases.

asr-007995
08:08:34.270 --> 08:08:44.370
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, pwede ho ba, Madam Chair, Secretary, na ibalik ho sana natin yung apat na gamot na pinupunduhan nyo before?

asr-007996
08:08:44.830 --> 08:08:49.190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi ito po yung malaking tulong sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-007997
08:08:49.190 --> 08:08:50.790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung Amlodipine, Losexine.

asr-007998
08:08:50.830 --> 08:08:54.470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Zertan, Clopidogrel, Metformin.

asr-007999
08:08:55.150 --> 08:08:58.670
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: At parang nakita ho namin is, nawala na po ito.

asr-008000
08:08:59.330 --> 08:09:04.870
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Anyway, turapap po, para minsanan na lang po, Secretary.

asr-008001
08:09:05.770 --> 08:09:17.470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Doon sa mga DOH H-52 natin, kasi nakita na ho natin na may mga nalagyan ng pondo for 2027 sa NEP natin,

asr-008002
08:09:17.470 --> 08:09:18.970
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: pero hindi po siya.

asr-008003
08:09:19.310 --> 08:09:19.470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala pong...

asr-008004
08:09:20.830 --> 08:09:23.490
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala pong facility na gano'n doon sa lugar ko.

asr-008005
08:09:24.230 --> 08:09:26.550
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Same din sa mga ibang lugar.

asr-008006
08:09:27.230 --> 08:09:36.730
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, also with siguro pinupunduhan ng isang politician, but then wala po doon sa lugar ho namin.

asr-008007
08:09:37.330 --> 08:09:45.010
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, doon sa equipments, if magpupundo po tayo ng mga facilities, mga structure, mga infra,

asr-008008
08:09:45.010 --> 08:09:50.510
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: sana yung tapos na na-infra, yun ang bibigyan natin ng equipments.

asr-008009
08:09:50.830 --> 08:09:59.890
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Equipments, equipping, hindi po natin pagsabayin yung infra at saka yung equipping.

asr-008010
08:10:00.210 --> 08:10:07.930
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi, eh di, nandatinga na lang yung equipments, masasayang din, masisira kung wala pa yung structure.

asr-008011
08:10:08.750 --> 08:10:19.710
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sana i-review po natin ulit, kasi sayang yung pera natin, pera ng gobyerno, kung gagawin po natin lagi yung gano'n.

asr-008012
08:10:19.710 --> 08:10:20.710
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, there are...

asr-008013
08:10:20.830 --> 08:10:28.270
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: There are some facilities doon sa amin na walang, tapos na yung mga infra, pero wala naman silang equipments.

asr-008014
08:10:28.890 --> 08:10:37.370
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, sana po, kasi nanggaling po ako as a public health, nakita ko ho na yung mga pinupunduhan natin before,

asr-008015
08:10:37.670 --> 08:10:43.170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: yung mga BP up, yung mga weighing scale, kaya na po ng LGU na magpundo doon.

asr-008016
08:10:43.170 --> 08:10:49.170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sana ang punduhan ng DOH ay yung mga malalaking equipments like the...

asr-008017
08:10:50.830 --> 08:10:52.850
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung equipments na kailangan ho natin.

asr-008018
08:10:54.310 --> 08:10:55.170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then...

asr-008019
08:10:55.170 --> 08:10:55.930
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you for caring.

asr-008020
08:10:55.930 --> 08:10:56.790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair, isa na lang.

asr-008021
08:10:57.230 --> 08:11:00.230
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa amin, yung DOH na...

asr-008022
08:11:00.230 --> 08:11:02.990
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa amin po, wala po kasing...

asr-008023
08:11:02.990 --> 08:11:13.770
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala po kami yung DOH Managed Hospital sa Kalinga Provincial Hospital until now, nasa Senate na po, and hope matatapos na rin to.

asr-008024
08:11:13.770 --> 08:11:19.190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And sa mga FLR projects ho natin, na 2025-2026,

asr-008025
08:11:20.830 --> 08:11:25.950
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: na FLR bago po yung napunduhan for the NEP on 2027 na Super RHU.

asr-008026
08:11:26.170 --> 08:11:27.310
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-008027
08:11:28.110 --> 08:11:30.650
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat, Secretary and the DOH family.

asr-008028
08:11:31.270 --> 08:11:33.970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, well noted po. Maganda po mga suggestions.

asr-008029
08:11:34.650 --> 08:11:35.850
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Kong.

asr-008030
08:11:36.230 --> 08:11:40.610
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang next po natin is Kong Edwin Cruzado. Go ahead po, Kong.

asr-008031
08:11:40.610 --> 08:11:43.410
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Good evening to everyone.

asr-008032
08:11:44.310 --> 08:11:49.150
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: To our chairman.

asr-008033
08:11:50.830 --> 08:11:56.510
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sa ating Secretary of Health and Dr. Mercado, Dr. Ho.

asr-008034
08:11:57.710 --> 08:12:04.490
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Gusto kong pasalamatan ng PhilHealth kasi for the last two years, actually, you have already doubled the premium.

asr-008035
08:12:05.610 --> 08:12:09.230
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So maraming mga hospital na medyo nakaangat, nakabangon.

asr-008036
08:12:10.250 --> 08:12:14.010
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: At saka yung mga doctors din, okay naman din ang natatanggap nila.

asr-008037
08:12:14.910 --> 08:12:19.270
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So thank you, Dr. Mercado. Ikaw yung ano, naging ano niyan.

asr-008038
08:12:20.830 --> 08:12:23.910
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sa magandang trabaho mo, good job, no?

asr-008039
08:12:23.910 --> 08:12:30.330
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sana ipagpatuloy ng ating Dr. Ho, na siyang president ngayon ng PhilHealth.

asr-008040
08:12:31.590 --> 08:12:39.910
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Actually, with regards to financing, medyo okay naman ang financing natin sa PhilHealth.

asr-008041
08:12:41.850 --> 08:12:45.070
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Yung utilization na lang ang dapat nating bantayan.

asr-008042
08:12:45.850 --> 08:12:48.350
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Saka ang challenge sa ating Secretary,

asr-008043
08:12:48.350 --> 08:12:50.670
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: na sana wala nang,

asr-008044
08:12:50.830 --> 08:12:54.270
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: masyadong expiring na gamot kasi

asr-008045
08:12:54.270 --> 08:12:57.070
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: municipal health officer din ako for a long time

asr-008046
08:12:57.070 --> 08:12:59.030
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: and a practitioner ng surgery.

asr-008047
08:13:00.390 --> 08:13:05.770
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: And we always experience that na kung may mga expired na,

asr-008048
08:13:06.450 --> 08:13:08.850
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: bibigyan na kami ng maraming supply.

asr-008049
08:13:09.730 --> 08:13:11.950
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So sana maging maingat tayo sa purchasing.

asr-008050
08:13:12.690 --> 08:13:17.010
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: At saka dapat sana yung ating immunization program,

asr-008051
08:13:18.990 --> 08:13:20.590
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: tutukan na natin para,

asr-008052
08:13:20.830 --> 08:13:22.610
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: magkaroon na tayo ng mga supplies.

asr-008053
08:13:22.610 --> 08:13:24.610
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: May mga question lang kasi ako, no?

asr-008054
08:13:25.550 --> 08:13:27.930
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sa, with regards sa hospital,

asr-008055
08:13:28.430 --> 08:13:32.730
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: kasi ang issue natin yung out of pocket is malaki, no?

asr-008056
08:13:34.470 --> 08:13:43.510
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ang government hospital natin is 90% should be allocated for NBB.

asr-008057
08:13:43.510 --> 08:13:45.510
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Tama ba ko, Sec? No?

asr-008058
08:13:46.050 --> 08:13:46.550
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Okay.

asr-008059
08:13:46.950 --> 08:13:48.950
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: And then sa private hospital,

asr-008060
08:13:49.590 --> 08:13:50.670
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: should be 10% na hospital.

asr-008061
08:13:50.670 --> 08:13:55.990
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ang bed capacity nila should be allocated for No-Balance Billing.

asr-008062
08:13:57.190 --> 08:14:00.250
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So, presently, ang reality is,

asr-008063
08:14:01.110 --> 08:14:05.450
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: dahil kaya ng ating government hospital medical centers

asr-008064
08:14:05.450 --> 08:14:08.030
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: to provide good equipments,

asr-008065
08:14:09.050 --> 08:14:12.630
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: at saka pwedeng mag-private ang private practice doon,

asr-008066
08:14:13.230 --> 08:14:16.230
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: karamihan ng ating mga pasyente ay nadadagsaan

asr-008067
08:14:16.230 --> 08:14:18.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: doon sa mga medical centers.

asr-008068
08:14:18.430 --> 08:14:23.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Kasi we can afford good equipments sa ICU.

asr-008069
08:14:23.430 --> 08:14:28.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: They can even afford to buy robotics in surgery.

asr-008070
08:14:28.430 --> 08:14:31.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ang tanong ko lang dito is,

asr-008071
08:14:31.430 --> 08:14:35.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: na-implement ba talaga yung 90% No-Balance Billing?

asr-008072
08:14:35.430 --> 08:14:41.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: O baka mas marami ng private cases na kine-cater yung mga medical centers?

asr-008073
08:14:41.430 --> 08:14:46.430
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Wherein, the doctors, the consultants who are practicing there,

asr-008074
08:14:46.430 --> 08:14:47.870
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: is charging,

asr-008075
08:14:47.870 --> 08:14:50.870
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: hindi mababa, kundi mataas.

asr-008076
08:14:50.870 --> 08:14:57.870
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So, sana magkaroon tayo ng ceiling man lang doon sa singilan.

asr-008077
08:15:00.000 --> 08:15:04.720
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: I appreciate, nung nagbisita ako doon sa Zamboanga Medical Center, sabi ko,

asr-008078
08:15:05.320 --> 08:15:12.100
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Doc Conti, paano mo ginagawa ang private dito sa hospital ninyo?

asr-008079
08:15:12.420 --> 08:15:20.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ang sabi niya, he limited the bed capacity, the beds sa Zamboanga Medical Center, lima lang sa surgery.

asr-008080
08:15:21.040 --> 08:15:22.020
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Not more than that.

asr-008081
08:15:23.200 --> 08:15:29.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So I hope na pwede din natin gawain na ganun that there should be limits.

asr-008082
08:15:30.000 --> 08:15:34.160
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Nanon ko yung isang kaibigan ko, of course, galing din ako.

asr-008083
08:15:35.100 --> 08:15:41.900
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Meron daw silang 500 na waiting list sa private cases sa surgery.

asr-008084
08:15:42.740 --> 08:15:48.720
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So kung meron kayong 500 waiting list, so paano na lang yung mga indigents?

asr-008085
08:15:49.380 --> 08:15:51.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Wala na siguro silang lugar dyan.

asr-008086
08:15:51.000 --> 08:15:57.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So ang akin lang, there should be somebody who will monitor yung implementation.

asr-008087
08:15:58.280 --> 08:15:59.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: And sana...

asr-008088
08:16:00.000 --> 08:16:01.660
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: We will have reports also.

asr-008089
08:16:02.440 --> 08:16:12.380
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Kung ilan ang ginawang indigent cases, ilan ang naging private in every government national hospital.

asr-008090
08:16:13.260 --> 08:16:15.180
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Wala akong problema sa ating UHC, ha?

asr-008091
08:16:15.620 --> 08:16:17.320
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: We are doing good, actually.

asr-008092
08:16:17.320 --> 08:16:24.800
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: But yung implementation na lang natin, at saka yung mga doctors natin, sana mayroon naman silang gano'ng ano.

asr-008093
08:16:25.400 --> 08:16:28.660
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Yung awa, kasi walang pili, kahit na mahirap.

asr-008094
08:16:30.000 --> 08:16:31.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: At sinisingil nila.

asr-008095
08:16:31.320 --> 08:16:33.000
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: My worst experience is this.

asr-008096
08:16:34.320 --> 08:16:36.600
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Humihingi sa akin ng tulong isang pasyente.

asr-008097
08:16:38.760 --> 08:16:39.320
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Hemorrhidectomy.

asr-008098
08:16:39.700 --> 08:16:40.760
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ginawa sa OPD.

asr-008099
08:16:41.380 --> 08:16:42.540
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Local anesthesia.

asr-008100
08:16:43.440 --> 08:16:45.300
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ang hospital bill is 1,000.

asr-008101
08:16:45.620 --> 08:16:47.880
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: But the doctor's fee is 60,000.

asr-008102
08:16:50.980 --> 08:16:52.340
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Humihingi ng tulong sa akin.

asr-008103
08:16:52.340 --> 08:16:53.980
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sabi ko, nabayaran mo naman yan.

asr-008104
08:16:54.100 --> 08:16:55.040
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Di wala na tayong magawa.

asr-008105
08:16:56.000 --> 08:16:58.600
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: I could not answer for the...

asr-008106
08:16:58.600 --> 08:17:01.200
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Hindi ko na ma-charge yan sa maip ko.

asr-008107
08:17:01.980 --> 08:17:02.140
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So...

asr-008108
08:17:02.300 --> 08:17:04.800
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Ano lang, monitoring lang po, sir.

asr-008109
08:17:05.500 --> 08:17:12.300
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: And the second concern ko, yung problema ng hospital waste sa district.

asr-008110
08:17:12.300 --> 08:17:14.560
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Kasi marami tayong hospital waste.

asr-008111
08:17:14.860 --> 08:17:21.360
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Tapos, yung paano siya i-dispose.

asr-008112
08:17:21.740 --> 08:17:26.300
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So, we are paying 50,000 to 85,000 per kilo may kumukulikta.

asr-008113
08:17:26.980 --> 08:17:30.300
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Pwede bang matulungan din ang distrito na magkaroon ng...

asr-008114
08:17:30.300 --> 08:17:34.840
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Treatment, storage, and disposal facilities.

asr-008115
08:17:35.320 --> 08:17:36.200
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Yun lang po, SEC.

asr-008116
08:17:36.820 --> 08:17:39.280
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Thank you very much and magandang hapon sa inyong lahat.

asr-008117
08:17:40.300 --> 08:17:41.880
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you, Kong Edwin.

asr-008118
08:17:42.900 --> 08:17:47.460
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Would SEC want to reply or sa mga issues ni Kong?

asr-008119
08:17:49.260 --> 08:17:51.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-008120
08:17:51.500 --> 08:17:57.100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung PF nga po ay isang issue na kailangan po nating ayusin.

asr-008121
08:17:57.740 --> 08:18:00.140
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang plano po namin ay...

asr-008122
08:18:00.140 --> 08:18:01.600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ay talaga pong yung networking.

asr-008123
08:18:02.480 --> 08:18:06.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ngayon, kulungan po na encounter yung...

asr-008124
08:18:06.300 --> 08:18:09.440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang haba ng pila sa government hospital kasi ginagawang private.

asr-008125
08:18:10.000 --> 08:18:16.300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang kalimitan po, mahaba ang pila sa government hospital kasi hinihintay nila yung charity ward beds.

asr-008126
08:18:16.460 --> 08:18:20.620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya yun po, nasusolusyonan na namin dito sa Manila.

asr-008127
08:18:20.780 --> 08:18:22.160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Example po, ang PGH.

asr-008128
08:18:22.340 --> 08:18:25.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po rin 300 na backlog sa breast.

asr-008129
08:18:25.020 --> 08:18:28.380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ginagawa po nila, may ginagawa yung work up sa PGH,

asr-008130
08:18:28.840 --> 08:18:30.020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: inoooperahan sa isang...

asr-008131
08:18:30.140 --> 08:18:31.040
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: private hospital.

asr-008132
08:18:31.660 --> 08:18:35.180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pabanggiting ko na, sa Asian o sa Cardinal.

asr-008133
08:18:35.700 --> 08:18:38.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang PGH po yung magkiklaim ng aming Z-BEN.

asr-008134
08:18:39.420 --> 08:18:43.940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nag-agree na po sila with Cardinal, magkano po yung ibabayad doon sa operating portion.

asr-008135
08:18:44.800 --> 08:18:47.080
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya yun po, nagagawa na po namin.

asr-008136
08:18:47.240 --> 08:18:49.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya yun nga po yung ating tinatawag na network.

asr-008137
08:18:50.340 --> 08:18:54.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi ang mga PhilHealth naman po is willing to pay.

asr-008138
08:18:54.000 --> 08:18:57.800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And then we can add yung maipip doon sa mga outliers.

asr-008139
08:18:58.580 --> 08:18:59.000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero po yung...

asr-008140
08:19:00.140 --> 08:19:04.900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Dito po sa ginagawa po na, ginagawang private nung mga charity,

asr-008141
08:19:05.520 --> 08:19:08.700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: doon ng mga doktor po sa ating government hospital.

asr-008142
08:19:08.820 --> 08:19:11.740
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pag-aaralan po natin paano po sila ma-engage.

asr-008143
08:19:13.000 --> 08:19:14.080
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-008144
08:19:15.180 --> 08:19:16.960
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Kong Edwin.

asr-008145
08:19:17.180 --> 08:19:18.180
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Secretary, thank you.

asr-008146
08:19:18.280 --> 08:19:21.400
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang next po is our Representative Christopher Yap.

asr-008147
08:19:23.700 --> 08:19:24.560
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Go ahead po, Kong.

asr-008148
08:19:28.330 --> 08:19:34.450
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Mayong hapon, kanatong tanan sa atong DOH family and their affiliate agencies.

asr-008149
08:19:34.850 --> 08:19:44.270
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: So, establishment of the proposed hospital has been a long-standing legislative priority

asr-008150
08:19:44.270 --> 08:19:48.310
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: that I have been actively pursuing for the past four years.

asr-008151
08:19:48.470 --> 08:19:53.330
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Beginning my first time as member of House of Representatives.

asr-008152
08:19:54.710 --> 08:19:59.250
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Sinabi dati ni Secretary Herbosa that na bawat probinsya na malayo,

asr-008153
08:19:59.750 --> 08:20:02.050
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: kailangan mayroong DOH-run hospital.

asr-008154
08:20:03.050 --> 08:20:06.610
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: It's been four years nung una kong sinabi dito,

asr-008155
08:20:06.670 --> 08:20:10.090
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: about what I had personal experience.

asr-008156
08:20:11.450 --> 08:20:15.410
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: More than a decade ago, my father died on the road.

asr-008157
08:20:16.350 --> 08:20:21.590
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Because of the nearest complete hospital is three hours away from us.

asr-008158
08:20:22.830 --> 08:20:23.590
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Walang ICU.

asr-008159
08:20:25.430 --> 08:20:26.410
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: May sasakyan kami.

asr-008160
08:20:27.910 --> 08:20:30.430
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Paano pa kaya yung ordinary Filipino?

asr-008161
08:20:30.430 --> 08:20:33.910
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Na walang access, walang sasakyan.

asr-008162
08:20:34.390 --> 08:20:38.000
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: So, I hope, Secretary-March.

asr-008163
08:20:38.240 --> 08:20:40.560
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: I will consider it.

asr-008164
08:20:41.200 --> 08:20:47.720
Rep. Christopherson "Coco" M. Yap: Gusto lang namin na may chance mabuhay yung mga tao, constituents namin sa Southern Leyta.

asr-008165
08:20:52.480 --> 08:21:00.840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, again, dahil po gumaganda na yung payment ng PhilHealth,

asr-008166
08:21:00.940 --> 08:21:04.560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: gaya nga nang sabi ni Kong Gonzaga earlier,

asr-008167
08:21:05.760 --> 08:21:11.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: may revenue stream po na pwede nang gamitin for expansion ng isang hospital.

asr-008168
08:21:11.340 --> 08:21:12.340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, it's just...

asr-008169
08:21:12.340 --> 08:21:16.200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: It's a matter talaga of may konting upfront investment.

asr-008170
08:21:16.520 --> 08:21:21.260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi pwede pong para gumanda po ang revenue stream ng isang district hospital,

asr-008171
08:21:21.560 --> 08:21:24.060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kailangan talaga po mag-invest dun sa mga gamit.

asr-008172
08:21:24.780 --> 08:21:31.280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yung initial phase, kasi matagal pa rin po kung sakaling ipapasay yung bill or legislation

asr-008173
08:21:31.280 --> 08:21:33.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ng conversion to a DOH hospital,

asr-008174
08:21:33.500 --> 08:21:38.660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay tulungan pong makapagpuntar ng mga basic equipment,

asr-008175
08:21:39.300 --> 08:21:41.500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mga OR instruments,

asr-008176
08:21:42.340 --> 08:21:44.620
